{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-87d21d8e-0565-4c7d-9efe-73f86480e795-75","title":"spawn_subagent","kind":"task","status":"pending","toolName":"spawn_subagent","rawInput":{"description":"Annotate common_ui SWF","prompt":"You are annotating decompiled Flash UI ActionScript for Bleach vs Naruto 3.3 (play5d). Write Chinese markdown line-by-line reverse docs.\n\nDO NOT modify anything under /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/\nDO NOT play/rebuild SWF.\nONLY write markdown under /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/\n\n## Output files (8) — mirror path after decompiled/ui/, .as → .md\n1. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/common_ui_fla/MainTimeline.md\n2. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/common_ui_fla/wzimg_bgimg_5.md\n3. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/logo_movie.md\n4. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/mc_congratulations.md\n5. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/mc_win_all.md\n6. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/mc_wzbtn.md\n7. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/select_arrow_mc.md\n8. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/common_ui/scripts/trans_mc.md\n\nSources: /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/common_ui/scripts/**\n\n## Quality (match fighters/engine)\nEach md:\n- Title: `# \\`ClassName\\` — 短中文用途`\n- 一句话目的\n- 源文件 path + 行数\n- ## 如何挂上引擎 — ResUtils.I.common_ui linkage, which engine class new/createDisplayObject, states\n- ## 逐行说明 — every function + non-trivial frame/action with L.. refs. addFrameScript first arg is 0-based: index N = 时间轴 F{N+1}.\n- Tiny artwork stubs still get a full short file (purpose + size/export + fields).\n- Mark `?` when unsure.\n- Cross-link engine docs with relative paths from THIS file:\n  - From ui/common_ui/scripts/*.md: `../../../engine/game/bvn/...`\n  - From ui/common_ui/scripts/common_ui_fla/*.md: `../../../../engine/game/bvn/...`\n- Keep destory/fadIn/confrim spellings.\n- Chinese. No placeholder TODO.\n\n## Engine hooks (verified)\n- ResUtils.I.common_ui; 8 UI SWFs loadBytes into ApplicationDomain.currentDomain so getDefinition can find names even if caller passes a different SWF Class.\n- logo_movie: LogoState createDisplayObject(common_ui,\"logo_movie\"); gotoAndPlay(2); listen complete. F1 stop; F66 stop+COMPLETE. Engine docs: reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/LogoState.md (if exists) else state notes.\n- mc_congratulations: CongratulateState ResUtils.CONGRATULATIONS; gotoAndPlay(2); complete. F50 stop+COMPLETE.\n- mc_win_all: CongratulateState createDisplayObject(common_ui,\"mc_win_all\") — empty timeline, artwork only.\n- mc_wzbtn: MenuBtn createDisplayObject(common_ui,\"mc_wzbtn\"). Field `bg:MovieClip` — MenuBtn uses ui.bg as highlight (frame 1 normal / frame 2 open; buttonMode, mouseChildren=false). See ../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/MenuBtn.md\n- wzimg_bgimg_5: likely nested bg art inside mc_wzbtn (symbol13 vs mc_wzbtn symbol14). F1 stop. Engine never createDisplayObject this name.\n- select_arrow_mc: GameOverState + SetBtnGroup createDisplayObject(common_ui,\"select_arrow_mc\"). Empty class, artwork arrow.\n- trans_mc: TransUI createDisplayObject(common_ui,\"trans_mc\"). F1 stop; F26 stop+COMPLETE; F61 stop+COMPLETE. TransUI does NOT listen COMPLETE; uses labels fadin/fadout/stop and nextFrame. See ../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/TransUI.md\n- common_ui_fla.MainTimeline: SWF document class, F1 stop. Engine never instantiates; ResUtils loadBytes the whole SWF.\n\nRead each .as fully. Read engine MenuBtn.md TransUI.md ResUtils.md LogoState if present. Write accurate L numbers from the .as files.\n\nAfter each file, mentally note PROGRESS. When done, return a checklist of the 8 paths written + 1-line each.","subagent_type":"general-purpose","background":true},"content":[],"locations":[]}
