{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-87d21d8e-0565-4c7d-9efe-73f86480e795-76","title":"spawn_subagent","kind":"task","status":"pending","toolName":"spawn_subagent","rawInput":{"description":"Annotate fight HUD clips","prompt":"You are annotating decompiled Flash UI ActionScript for Bleach vs Naruto 3.3 (play5d). Write Chinese markdown line-by-line reverse docs.\n\nDO NOT modify /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/\nONLY write markdown under /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/\n\n## Output (18 files)\nMirror decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/ → reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/, .as→.md\n\n1. ui_fight.md\n2. hpbar_mc.md\n3. hpbar_barmc.md\n4. hpbar_facegroup.md\n5. hpbar_facemc.md\n6. energy_bar.md\n7. energybar_barmc.md\n8. fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md\n9. fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md\n10. time_mc.md\n11. time_txtmc.md\n12. score_mc.md\n13. txtmc_score.md\n14. txt_mc.md\n15. winmc.md\n16. fight_fla/winmc_bleach_22.md\n17. player_pos_p1.md\n18. player_pos_p2.md\n\nSources under /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/\n\n## Format\n# `ClassName` — 短中文用途\n一句话目的\n源文件 + 行数\n## 如何挂上引擎 (ResUtils.I.fight, FightUI/FightBar/EnergyBar/FighterHpBar/FightFace*/FightTimeUI/FightScoreUI/WinUI)\n## 逐行说明 with L.. refs. addFrameScript N = 时间轴 F{N+1}.\nTiny stubs still one md each.\nCross-link:\n- From ui/fight/scripts/*.md: `../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md` etc\n- From fight_fla/*.md: `../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/...`\nChinese. Mark ?. Keep destory/fadIn spellings.\n\n## Verified engine wiring\nREAD these engine docs and the .as sources:\n- reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md\n- FightBar.md FighterHpBar.md EnergyBar.md FightFaceGroup.md FightFaceUI.md FightTimeUI.md FightScoreUI.md\n- reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/WinUI.md\n\nFacts:\n- FightUI: createDisplayObject(fight,\"ui_fight\"). Children: hpbarmc:hpbar_mc, fzqi1/2:qbar_mc, hits1/2:hits_mc, startKOmc:MovieClip (runtime fight_fla.game_start_mc_44). Also createDisplayObject player_pos_p1/p2.\n- hpbar_mc fields: bar1/bar2 hpbar_barmc, energy1/2 energy_bar, face1/2 hpbar_facegroup, scoremc, timemc, win_p1/win_p2 winmc. Frame scripts F1 stop; F25 stop+COMPLETE; F46 stop+COMPLETE. FightBar uses labels \"fadin\"/\"fadin_fin\"/\"fadout\"/\"destory\".\n- hpbar_barmc: bar + redbar. FighterHpBar scales them.\n- hpbar_facegroup: face/face2/face3 : hpbar_facemc. FightFaceGroup wraps this.\n- hpbar_facemc: ct container. FightFaceUI puts face bitmap in ct. setDirect is empty in engine.\n- energy_bar: barmc:energybar_barmc, txtmc:MovieClip. EnergyBar (体力 not 气).\n- energybar_barmc: bar. Nested fight_fla.energybar_bar_8 is likely the bar clip (F1 stop).\n- energybar_txt_mc_3: field mc. EnergyBar.InsTxt expects txtmc.mc. F1 stop. comicType 0=frame1 bleach / 1=frame2 naruto.\n- time_mc: wuxian MC. FightTimeUI: gameTimeMax==-1 shows wuxian else MCNumber(time_txtmc).\n- time_txtmc / txtmc_score: digit MCs, F1 stop. getItemClass not nested instance.\n- score_mc: ct. FightScoreUI puts MCNumber in ct. Arcade only.\n- txt_mc: TextField txt. Engine AS does not createDisplayObject(\"txt_mc\") — nested/unused export? Mark ?.\n- winmc: w1, w2. WinUI.show: P1 win1→w1 win2→w2; P2 swapped. comicType 0 in_bleach / 1 in_naruto.\n- winmc_bleach_22: nested win lamp animation. F1/F20/F40 stop. Likely idle / in_bleach end / in_naruto end? Map to WinUI labels; mark ? if labels not in AS.\n- player_pos_p1/p2: empty MCs. FightUI.getPlayerPos offscreen markers when zoom≤1.8.\n\nDocument every public var. For hpbar_mc document every frame script.\n\nReturn checklist of 18 paths when done.","subagent_type":"general-purpose","background":true},"content":[],"locations":[]}
