{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-87d21d8e-0565-4c7d-9efe-73f86480e795-77","title":"spawn_subagent","kind":"task","status":"pending","toolName":"spawn_subagent","rawInput":{"description":"Annotate fight qbar/hits/KO","prompt":"You are annotating decompiled Flash UI ActionScript for Bleach vs Naruto 3.3 (play5d). Write Chinese markdown line-by-line reverse docs.\n\nDO NOT modify /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/\nONLY write markdown under /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/\n\n## Output (15 files) under reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/\n1. qbar_mc.md\n2. qbar_barmc.md\n3. qbar_barmcgroup.md\n4. qbar_facemc.md\n5. qbar_fzqi_mc.md\n6. fight_fla/qbar_txtmc_34.md\n7. hits_mc.md\n8. hits_num_mc.md\n9. bsface_mc.md\n10. fight_fla/game_start_mc_44.md  **LARGE — group by label/frame; document every callback / field**\n11. fight_fla/round_num_mc_45.md\n12. fight_fla/元件10_4.md\n13. fight_fla/元件11_6.md\n14. fight_fla/元件12_10.md\n15. fight_fla/元件25_46.md\n\nSources: /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/**\n\n## Format\nChinese. One-line purpose, engine hook, 逐行说明 with L.. refs.\naddFrameScript N = 时间轴 F{N+1}.\nCross-link from scripts/*.md: `../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/...`\nfrom fight_fla/*.md: `../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/...`\nMark ?. Keep destory/fadIn.\n\nREAD:\n- reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md (startKOmc labels)\n- QiBar.md HitsUI.md\n\n## Verified facts\n\n### qbar\nqbar_mc: barmc:qbar_barmc, facemc:qbar_facemc, fzqibar:qbar_fzqi_mc, readymc:MovieClip.\nF1 stop; F15 stop+COMPLETE; F38 stop+COMPLETE. QiBar labels fadin_fin / fadout / destory.\nFightUI binds ui.fzqi1/fzqi2. P2 setDirect(-1). qi 0-300 three bars + bar4 at 300; fzqi 0-100; face is ASSISTER not fighter.\nqbar_barmc: bar:qbar_barmcgroup, txtmc. QiBar.InsBar.\nqbar_barmcgroup: bar1..bar4.\nqbar_facemc: ct. QiBar puts assist face in ct.\nqbar_fzqi_mc: barmc. InsFzBar scrollRect height.\nqbar_txtmc_34: F1 stop. Digit/text for qi level; txtmc.gotoAndStop(int(process)+1).\n\n### hits\nhits_mc: ct, hitsmc. Frames:\nF1 stop visible=false\nF10 visible=true\nF20 stop (fadin done)\nF38 stop (update done)\nF56 gotoAndStop(1) fadout\nHitsUI: gotoAndPlay(\"fadin\"|\"update\"|\"fadout\"). hits1 shifts x by number width; hits2 does not.\nhits_num_mc: F1 stop. MCNumber class via getItemClass(fight,\"hits_num_mc\").\n\n### bsface_mc\nEmpty MC. Engine never createDisplayObject(\"bsface_mc\"). Character bisha faces are fighter SWF BitmapData via defineBishaFace. This is nested HUD art or leftover. Mark ?.\n\n### game_start_mc_44 (147 lines) — MOST IMPORTANT\nFields: nummc, winnermc, $round, $perfect, $winnerX, $winnerY\nFightUI.ui.startKOmc typed MovieClip but this is the class.\nFightUI writes $round, $perfect, $winnerX (not $winnerY, SWF default 90).\ngotoAndStop labels: \"start\" (round<5), \"start_final\" (round≥5), \"ko\", \"timeover\", \"drawgame\", \"winner\".\nEvents: \"fight\" (F58), Event.COMPLETE, also dispatches \"fight_in\" at F55 (FightUI does NOT listen fight_in).\nFrame scripts (0-based → F):\n- F1: init $round=1 $perfect=false $winnerX=30 $winnerY=90; stop\n- F27: clamp $round 1..5; nummc.gotoAndPlay(\"r\"+$round)\n- F28: nummc.gotoAndPlay(\"r\"+$round) again (start_final path?)\n- F55: dispatch \"fight_in\"\n- F58: dispatch \"fight\"\n- F88: stop + COMPLETE  (start sequence end)\n- F190: stop + COMPLETE (ko)\n- F200: position winnermc, isPerfect\n- F201: same\n- F210: stop; winnermc COMPLETE → bubble COMPLETE\n- F263: stop + COMPLETE (timeover?)\n- F309: stop + COMPLETE (drawgame?)\nMap these to FightUI.md table. Group by label. Document that renderStartAndKO nextFrame()s the clip (not play()).\n\n### round_num_mc_45\nStops F1, F17, F34, F51, F67, F82. Used as nummc; labels r1..r5. 6 stops = idle + r1-r5 or r1-r5 + extra. Mark ?.\n\n### 元件25_46\nisPerfect field. F1 isPerfect=false. F29 if !isPerfect: stop+COMPLETE. F56 stop+COMPLETE.\nThis IS winnermc: perfect continues to F56 for PERFECT anim. game_start_mc_44 sets winnermc.isPerfect.\n\n### 元件10_4, 元件11_6\nF1 stop only. Nested artwork. Identify if possible from names/symbols; else \"嵌套美术，引擎不直接 new\".\n\n### 元件12_10\nfield mc; F1 stop. Nested.\n\nReturn checklist of 15 paths. game_start_mc_44 must NOT be a stub — full frame table.","subagent_type":"general-purpose","background":true},"content":[],"locations":[]}
