{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-87d21d8e-0565-4c7d-9efe-73f86480e795-78","title":"spawn_subagent","kind":"task","status":"pending","toolName":"spawn_subagent","rawInput":{"description":"Annotate gameover howtoplay title","prompt":"You are annotating decompiled Flash UI ActionScript for Bleach vs Naruto 3.3 (play5d). Write Chinese markdown line-by-line reverse docs.\n\nDO NOT modify /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/\nONLY write markdown under /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/\n\n## Output (7 files)\n1. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/gameover/scripts/stg_gameover_mc.md\n2. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/howtoplay/scripts/movie_howtoplay.md\n3. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/howtoplay/scripts/howtoplay_fla/arrow020321_6.md\n4. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/howtoplay/scripts/howtoplay_fla/元件48_11.md\n5. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/title/scripts/stg_title.md\n6. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/title/scripts/stg_test.md\n7. /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/title/scripts/title_fla/logomc_3.md\n\n## Format\nChinese. Purpose, engine hook, 逐行说明 L.. refs. addFrameScript N = F{N+1}.\nCross-link from scripts/*.md: `../../../engine/game/bvn/...`\nfrom *_fla/*.md: `../../../../engine/game/bvn/...`\nLarge MainTimeline-like clips: group by label; document every btn / text field / callback.\n\nREAD engine sources:\n- decompiled/main/scripts/net/play5d/game/bvn/state/GameOverState.as\n- HowToPlayState.as\n- MenuState.as\nAnd any reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/*.md\n\n## Verified facts\n\n### stg_gameover_mc (51 lines)\nResUtils.GAME_OVER = \"stg_gameover_mc\". GameOverState createDisplayObject(gameover, GAME_OVER); gotoAndStop(1).\nFields: btn_back, btn_no, btn_yes, ct_char, ct_score.\nLabels used by engine: \"continue\", \"continue_yes\", \"continue_no\", \"gameover\".\nFrame scripts:\n- F50 stop+COMPLETE\n- F85 stop+COMPLETE\n- F124 stop+COMPLETE\n- F238 stop+COMPLETE\nMap these to the 4 labels (order likely continue → continue_yes → continue_no → gameover, or similar). Document mapping as inferred from COMPLETE after each gotoAndPlay; mark ? if not labeled in AS.\nEngine: showContinue plays \"continue\" then initBtn yes/no + arrow from common_ui select_arrow_mc.\nYES → continue_yes; NO → continue_no; later gameover + btn_back → goLogo.\nct_char / ct_score: GameOverState.addChar etc — read GameOverState fully.\n\n### movie_howtoplay (52 lines)\nHowToPlayState: createDisplayObject(howtoplay,\"movie_howtoplay\"); gotoAndPlay(2); listen complete → goSelect.\nFields: skip_btn:SimpleButton; txt_up/down/left/right/attack/jump/dash/skill/bisha/special : TextField.\nEngine fills those from KeyConfigVO P1 via KyoKeyCode.code2name.\nF1 stop; F1211 stop+COMPLETE.\ngotoAndPlay(\"skip\") on back/select or skip_btn click.\ndestory: gotoAndStop(\"destory\").\nDocument EVERY text field and skip_btn.\n\n### arrow020321_6\nF5 stop. Nested howtoplay arrow art.\n\n### 元件48_11\nF17 stop. Nested.\n\n### stg_title (33 lines)\nResUtils.TITLE. MenuState createDisplayObject(title, TITLE); gotoAndStop(1); afterBuild gotoAndPlay(2); click/anyKey → gotoAndPlay(\"menu\"); then btnct gets MenuBtnGroup (or addChild to _ui if no btnct).\nFields: btnct, logo_mc.\nF50 stop+COMPLETE; F75 stop+COMPLETE.\nLikely F50 = intro complete (click to continue already enabled at 500ms); F75 = menu pose COMPLETE? MenuState does not listen COMPLETE on title — it uses click/key. Document that.\nlogo_mc is title_fla.logomc_3 instance?\n\n### logomc_3\nFields: logo_5dplay, logo_5dplay_bbs, logo_android.\nF1: visible=false. Hidden by default — maybe platform logo selector. Engine GameInterface.instance.initTitleUI(_ui) might show one. Read MenuState and GameInterface if present. Mark ?.\n\n### stg_test\nEmpty MovieClip. Engine never references \"stg_test\". Leftover test stage in title.swf.\n\nRead each .as. Return checklist of 7.","subagent_type":"general-purpose","background":true},"content":[],"locations":[]}
