{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-87d21d8e-0565-4c7d-9efe-73f86480e795-79","title":"spawn_subagent","kind":"task","status":"pending","toolName":"spawn_subagent","rawInput":{"description":"Annotate loading SWF","prompt":"You are annotating decompiled Flash UI ActionScript for Bleach vs Naruto 3.3 (play5d). Write Chinese markdown line-by-line reverse docs.\n\nDO NOT modify /workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/\nONLY write markdown under /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/\n\n## Output (12 files) under reverse/line-by-line/ui/loading/scripts/\n1. cover_bgimg.md\n2. loading_cover_mc.md\n3. loading_fight_mc.md\n4. loading_select_ui_mc.md\n5. loadingbar_mc.md\n6. loading_fla/MainTimeline.md\n7. loading_fla/元件8_17.md\n8. select_arrow_mc_1.md\n9. select_arrow_mc_2.md\n10. seltwzmc.md\n11. winner_stg_mc.md\n12. winner_stg_mc2.md\n\n## Format\nChinese. Purpose, engine hook, 逐行说明 L.. . addFrameScript N = F{N+1}.\nCross-link scripts/*.md: `../../../engine/game/bvn/...`\n*_fla: `../../../../engine/game/bvn/...`\n\nREAD:\n- reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md\n- decompiled/main/scripts/net/play5d/game/bvn/state/GameLoadingState.as\n- LoadingState.as\n- WinnerState.as\n- GameLogic.as around ResUtils.WINNER\n- SelectedFighterUI.as SelectIndexUI.as\n\n## Critical pattern\nAll 8 UI SWFs loadBytes into ApplicationDomain.currentDomain. getItemClass(swfClass, name) uses that domain.getDefinition — first arg only needs ANY pooled SWF. So engine sometimes names the wrong library:\n\n1. loading_fight_mc is decompiled under ui/loading/ (loading.swf) BUT LoadingState.build uses ResUtils.I.fight,\"loading_fight_mc\". Document both. It still works because currentDomain.\n2. seltwzmc / select_arrow_mc_1 / select_arrow_mc_2 live in loading.swf decompile BUT SelectedFighterUI / SelectIndexUI createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select, those names). Same currentDomain trick. Also possible select.swf exports same linkage — this decompile batch only has them under loading.\n3. cover_bgimg decompiled here as BitmapData 804×604, but CongratulateState/CreditsState createBitmapData(ResUtils.I.common_ui,\"cover_bgimg\", GAME_SIZE). Document mismatch. Default ctor 804×604 vs engine 800×600.\n\n## Verified facts\n\n### loading_cover_mc\nGameLoadingState: createDisplayObject(loading,\"loading_cover_mc\"). Field bar:loadingbar_mc.\n_ui.bar.bar.scaleX = progress; _ui.bar.txt.text = msg.\n\n### loadingbar_mc\nbar:MovieClip, txt:TextField. Shared by cover and select ui.\n\n### loading_fight_mc\nField sltui:loading_select_ui_mc. LoadingState: _ui.sltui; addChild SelectIndexUI; _sltUI.bar.bar.scaleX; _sltUI.bar.txt.text.\n\n### loading_select_ui_mc\nField bar:loadingbar_mc.\n\n### loading_fla.MainTimeline\nDoc class F1 stop. Engine never new.\n\n### 元件8_17\nF1 stop; F10 stop+COMPLETE. Nested loading anim.\n\n### select_arrow_mc_1 / _2\nEmpty MCs. SelectIndexUI P1 arrow from select_arrow_mc_1 offset (-10,30); P2 from _2 offset (260,30).\n\n### seltwzmc\nEmpty MC. SelectedFighterUI.setFighterIndex: gotoAndStop(param1) 1/2/3 for team slot number overlay. setAssister: gotoAndStop(4). P1 x=-8; P2 x=252-width or 176 for assist.\n\n### winner_stg_mc (48 lines)\nResUtils.WINNER default \"winner_stg_mc\". WinnerState createDisplayObject(loading, WINNER).\nFields: btns, f0, f1, f2, scoremc, txtmc.\nF92 stop+COMPLETE+txtmc.gotoAndPlay(2).\nWinnerState: scoremc.addChild BitmapFontText SCORE; f0/f1/f2 addChildAt winner faces; on complete bind btns.btn_more / btn_cont / btn_exit click+mouseOver.\ndestory: gotoAndStop(\"destory\").\nDocument every field and btn names (btns children not typed in AS — engine getChildByName(\"btns\") then btn_more/cont/exit).\n\n### winner_stg_mc2\nSame structure/scripts as winner_stg_mc. GameLogic.setGameMode(1) sets ResUtils.WINNER=\"winner_stg_mc2\" (old salect.xml grid); mode 0 restores winner_stg_mc. localhost debug F8/F9. Document as variant layout.\n\nReturn checklist of 12.","subagent_type":"general-purpose","background":true},"content":[],"locations":[]}
