erGroup.md MapSelectUI.md\n- SetBtn.md SetBtnDialog.md SetCtrlBtnUI.md SetBtnGroup.md\n- decompiled SettingState.as SelectFighterStage.as (partial)\n\n## Verified facts\n\n### stg_select\nResUtils.SELECT. SelectFighterStage createDisplayObject(select, SELECT). Field bg:MovieClip. Empty ctor — grid items added in code.\n\n### select_item_mc\nSelecterItemUI cursor. Field mc:MovieClip. F1 stop. Engine: ui.mc.gotoAndStop(player==1?1:2); gotoAndPlay(\"select\") on confirm; mouseEnabled=false.\n\n### slt_item_mc\nSelectFighterItem grid cell. Field ct:MovieClip for 50×50 face.\n\n### selected_item_p1_mc / p2_mc\nField ct:ctmc. SelectUIFactory getItemClass these; SelectedFighterGroup new instances. SelectedFighterUI uses `ui is selected_item_p1_mc` for seltwzmc x offset.\n\n### ctmc\nField ct:MovieClip. Nested in selected items. SelectedFighterUI getChildByName(\"ct\") as ctmc.\n\n### select_map_mc\nMapSelectUI. Fields: bg, ct, kuang, left_arrow, right_arrow. Read MapSelectUI.md for how each is used.\n\n### select_map_txt_mc\nEmpty. MapSelectUI name plate under map; SHOW_CN_TEXT. Hosts BitmapText.\n\n### stg_set_ui\nResUtils.SETTING. SettingState. Field ichigo:MovieClip. _man = _ui.ichigo; gotoAndPlay(\"key_fadin\") when opening key config; \"key_fadout\" when leaving. SetBtnGroup added as child.\n\n### keyset_mc\nSetCtrlBtnUI. Field keysmc:MovieClip. Key rows live here.\n\n### key_set_dialog_mc\nSetBtnDialog. Fields: ct_keyname, ct_msg, txt:TextField. English BitmapFontText in ct_msg/ct_keyname; txt is Chinese 请按下一个键设置.\n\n### txt_arrow_mc\nSetBtn prev/next option arrows. Two instances.\n\n### setting_fla/元件1_13\nF15/F25/F35 stop. Nested ichigo or button anim? 3 stops may match key_fadin/hold/key_fadout. Mark ? and relate to ichigo labels.\n\nReturn checklist of 13.","subagent_type":"general-purpose","background":true},"content":[],"locations":[]}
