ll/bisha/special`。时间轴标签 `\"skip\"` / `\"destory\"` 只在 SWF 里，AS 导出类未见。"},{"line_number":23,"content":"`_ui:movie_howtoplay`。构造空。"},{"line_number":31,"content":"1. `createDisplayObject(howtoplay, \"movie_howtoplay\")`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-full-clean/net/play5d/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.as","matches":[{"line_number":21,"content":"      public static var TITLE:String = \"stg_title\";"},{"line_number":23,"content":"      public static var GAME_OVER:String = \"stg_gameover_mc\";"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/GameOverState.md","matches":[{"line_number":14,"content":"- **Callees**：`StateCtrl.clearTrans`；`ResUtils`（`gameover` SWF / `stg_gameover_mc` / `select_arrow_mc`）；`SoundCtrl`（BGM `continue`、`snd_gameover`、确认/选择音）；`AssetManager.getSound`/`getFont`；`GameInputer`（MENU 左右/select）；`GameRender.add/remove(render)`；`GameLogic.loseScoreByContinue`；`MainGame.goSelect` / `goLogo`；`GameEvent(\"GAME_OVER\")`；`GameCtrl.gameRunData.continueLoser` + `GameCtrl.destory`；`FighterMain`（**fighter，只作立绘**：scale/lose/idle/mc）；`setFrameOut`；`BitmapFontText`。"},{"line_number":20,"content":"- `stg_gameover_mc` 时间轴标签：`continue` / `continue_yes` / `continue_no` / `gameover`。自定义事件 `\"complete\"` 驱动阶段切换（不是 Event.COMPLETE 常量，是时间轴 `dispatchEvent`）。"},{"line_number":46,"content":"- `_ui:stg_gameover_mc`：gameover SWF 导出。"},{"line_number":56,"content":"`StateCtrl.I.clearTrans()`：进页前拆转场遮罩（其它 state 少这么做）。`ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.gameover, ResUtils.GAME_OVER)` → `stg_gameover_mc`，`gotoAndStop(1)`。**先于** `showContinue`/`showGameOver`，所以 `goStage` addChild 时 UI 已在。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/MenuState.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：片头之后的主菜单。播 `title_swf` 的 `stg_title`，任意键/点击后淡入 `MenuBtnGroup`（菜单数据来自 `GameInterface.getGameMenu` / `getDefaultMenu`）。"},{"line_number":10,"content":"- **Callees**：`ResUtils`（`title` SWF，导出名 `ResUtils.TITLE` = `\"stg_title\"`）；`GameInterface.instance.initTitleUI`（本包 `GameInterfaceManager` 空实现）；`SoundCtrl.BGM(\"op\")`；`GameInputer`；`GameRender.add/remove`；`MenuBtnGroup`（ui 包，不在本批）；`UIUtils.formatText`；`GameUI.alert`。"},{"line_number":18,"content":"- `stg_title` 时间轴：帧 50 / 帧 75 各 `stop` + `COMPLETE`；本类不听 complete，只 `gotoAndStop(1)` / `gotoAndPlay(2)` / `gotoAndPlay(\"menu\")`。"},{"line_number":35,"content":"1. `createDisplayObject(title, TITLE)` → `stg_title`。"},{"line_number":60,"content":"5. 优先挂到 `_ui` 子级 `\"btnct\"`（`stg_title.btnct`）；没有则直接 `_ui.addChild`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/_maps/ui-batch-files.txt","matches":[{"line_number":42,"content":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/gameover/scripts/stg_gameover_mc.as"},{"line_number":45,"content":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/howtoplay/scripts/movie_howtoplay.as"},{"line_number":71,"content":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/title/scripts/stg_test.as"},{"line_number":72,"content":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/title/scripts/stg_title.as"},{"line_number":73,"content":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/title/scripts/title_fla/logomc_3.as"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/MenuBtnGroup.md","matches":[{"line_number":9,"content":"- **Callers**：仅 `MenuState.showBtns`（L104–118）：`new MenuBtnGroup()`，`enabled=false`，坐标 **(470, 100)**，优先挂到 `stg_title` 子级 `\"btnct\"`，否则 `_ui.addChild`。然后 `build()` + `fadIn(0.2, 0.04)`，400ms 后 `enabled=true`。`MenuState.destory` 先 `parent.removeChild` 再 `destory()`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/web/GameInterfaceManager.md","matches":[{"line_number":43,"content":"空。`MenuState` 仍会把 `stg_title` 传进来。渠道可在此改标题层（加 Logo/广告）。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-full/net/play5d/game/bvn/state/HowToPlayState.as","matches":[{"line_number":37,"content":"         _ui = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.howtoplay,\"movie_howtoplay\");"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/_logs/gameover.log","matches":[{"line_number":6,"co