`common_ui` | `CONGRATULATIONS`=`mc_congratulations`；`logo_movie` / `mc_wzbtn` / `cover_bgimg` / `mc_win_all` / `select_arrow_mc` / `trans_mc` | `LogoState`、`MenuBtn`、`CongratulateState`、`CreditsState`、`GameOverState`、`SetBtnGroup`、`TransUI` |"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/GameOverState.md","matches":[{"line_number":14,"content":"- **Callees**：`StateCtrl.clearTrans`；`ResUtils`（`gameover` SWF / `stg_gameover_mc` / `select_arrow_mc`）；`SoundCtrl`（BGM `continue`、`snd_gameover`、确认/选择音）；`AssetManager.getSound`/`getFont`；`GameInputer`（MENU 左右/select）；`GameRender.add/remove(render)`；`GameLogic.loseScoreByContinue`；`MainGame.goSelect` / `goLogo`；`GameEvent(\"GAME_OVER\")`；`GameCtrl.gameRunData.continueLoser` + `GameCtrl.destory`；`FighterMain`（**fighter，只作立绘**：scale/lose/idle/mc）；`setFrameOut`；`BitmapFontText`。"},{"line_number":47,"content":"- `_arrow:select_arrow_mc`：公共 UI 箭头。"},{"line_number":96,"content":"无箭头则从 `common_ui` 建 `select_arrow_mc` 加到 `_ui`。可选 `setArrow`。`GameRender.add(render)`，`GameInputer.focus()`，`_keyEnabled=true`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md","matches":[{"line_number":14,"content":"- **Callees**：`SelectIndexUIGroup`、`GameData.I.p1Select/p2Select`、`GameMode.currentMode`、`ResUtils.I.select` → `\"select_arrow_mc_1\"` / `\"select_arrow_mc_2\"`（链接名也出现在 `loading` SWF；八 SWF 并入 `ApplicationDomain.currentDomain`，按名能取到）。"},{"line_number":101,"content":"`createDisplayObject(..., \"select_arrow_mc_1\")`，`initArrow(arrow, Point(-10, 30))`（箭头相对第一格）。`setKey(\"P1\")` 开始 `GameRender`。"},{"line_number":107,"content":"箭头 `\"select_arrow_mc_2\"`，偏移 `Point(260, 30)`（P2 卡片朝右，箭头在条右侧）。`param2==true` → `autoSelect()`（立刻 `selectFinish` → 本类 `onSelectFinish`，此时 P1 多半未完，函数空过）。否则 `setKey(param1)`（`\"P2\"` 或 `\"P1\"`）。`onFinish` 一律 `onSelectFinish`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/SetBtnGroup.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：竖排或横排一组 `SetBtn`，左边一枚 `select_arrow_mc` 当焦点。键盘走 `GameInputer`（默认 `\"MENU\"`），鼠标 hover/click，触摸 tap。子钮的 `\"SELECT\"` / `\"OPTION_CHANGE\"` 经 `SetBtnEvent.newEvent()` 再往上派，让外层 `currentTarget` 是 Group。设置主列表在 `getSettingMenu()` 为 null 时用内置 P1/P2 KEY SET … QUALITY，并硬加 APPLY。"},{"line_number":18,"content":"- **Callees**：`SetBtn`；`ResUtils.I.common_ui` 的 `select_arrow_mc`；`GameInterface.instance.getSettingMenu`；`GameData.I.config`（`getValueByKey`）；`GameRender.add/remove(render, this)`（**owner=`this`**，多实例必须分开桶）；`GameInputer.focus` / `enabled=true` / `up|down|left|right|select`；`SoundCtrl.I.sndSelect`；`TweenLite` 改 `scrollRect.y`；`SetBtnEvent.newEvent`。"},{"line_number":77,"content":"- `_arrow:select_arrow_mc`。"},{"line_number":166,"content":"`createDisplayObject(common_ui, \"select_arrow_mc\")`，`addChild`，`setArrowIndex(param1)` 默认 0。每次 `setBtnData` / `initMainSet` 都会再 new 一枚。第二次调用会留下旧箭头在显示列表里（本包各实例只 init 一次）。"}]}]},"locations":[]}
