`；`SetBtnGroup.initMainBtns` → `getSettingMenu`；`GameCtrl.buildGame` → `afterBuildGame`；`ConfigVO` 构造/`applyConfig`；`GameData.saveData/loadData`；`MainGame.moreGames/submitScore/showRank`；`MenuState.build` → `initTitleUI`；`WinnerState` → `moreGames`；`CreditsState` → `getCreadits`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/interfaces/IGameInterface.md","matches":[{"line_number":10,"content":"- **GIM 本包行为摘要**（实现细节不在本文件）：`initTitleUI` 空；`moreGames` → Hold.showGameList + `5d_message`；`submitScore` → Hold.showRefer；`showRank` → Hold.showSort；`saveGame/loadGame` → `KyoSharedObject` `\"bvn3_save\"`；`getGameInput` 忽略 type，总 `new GameKeyInput()`；`getGameMenu` = 默认树插入 RANK；`getSettingMenu` null（设置页用内置列表）；`updateInputConfig` false；`getConfigExtend` null；`afterBuildGame` 空；`applyConfig` 空；`getCreadits` 拼 5dplay/GreenHD HTML。"},{"line_number":21,"content":"- `initTitleUI(DisplayObject)`：标题 MC 建好后。本包空。其它渠道可挂 logo/广告。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-full-clean/net/play5d/game/bvn/web/GameInterfaceManager.as","matches":[{"line_number":33,"content":"      public function initTitleUI(param1:DisplayObject) : void"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-keepzl/net/play5d/game/bvn/interfaces/IGameInterface.as","matches":[{"line_number":11,"content":"      function initTitleUI(param1:DisplayObject) : void;"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-keepzl/net/play5d/game/bvn/state/MenuState.as","matches":[{"line_number":44,"content":"         GameInterface.instance.initTitleUI(_ui);"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/web/GameInterfaceManager.md","matches":[{"line_number":15,"content":"  - `MenuState.build` → `initTitleUI`"},{"line_number":41,"content":"### `initTitleUI`（L33–36）"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-noload/net/play5d/game/bvn/interfaces/IGameInterface.as","matches":[{"line_number":11,"content":"      function initTitleUI(param1:DisplayObject) : void;"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-keepzl/net/play5d/gam