,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],"stderr":[],"exit_code":0,"match_count":18,"file_matches":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/04-maps-ui-xml.md","matches":[{"line_number":63,"content":"| 226 | `fight_swf$…` | 258845 | `decompiled/ui/fight/` | 33 | `fight` | `ui_fight`、`hpbar_mc`、`qbar_mc`、`energy_bar`、`hits_mc`、`time_mc`、`score_mc`、`winmc`、`bsface_mc`、`player_pos_p1/p2` |"},{"line_number":90,"content":"**fight（33）**：`ui_fight.as`、`hpbar_*`、`qbar_*`、`energy_bar*`、`hits_*`、`time_*`、`score_mc`、`txt_mc`、`winmc`、`bsface_mc`、`player_pos_p1.as`、`player_pos_p2.as`、以及 `fight_fla/` 下 `game_start_mc_44`、`round_num_mc_45`、`winmc_bleach_22` 等元件类。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/CLASS-INDEX.md","matches":[{"line_number":1133,"content":"746. `ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/game_start_mc_44.as`"},{"line_number":1141,"content":"754. `ui/fight/scripts/hits_mc.as`"},{"line_number":1153,"content":"766. `ui/fight/scripts/qbar_mc.as`"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md","matches":[{"line_number":46,"content":"    ├── startKOmc       fight_fla.game_start_mc_44：ROUND/FIGHT/KO/…"},{"line_number":64,"content":"- `player_pos_*` 用 `getGameSpriteGlobalPosition(..., 0, -50)`。`GameState.md` 把这条写成「hits 数字」不准确——连击是 `hits_mc` 的 SWF 布局坐标，不跟角色。"},{"line_number":71,"content":"`fight_fla.game_start_mc_44` 字段：`$round`、`$perfect`、`$winnerX`、`$winnerY`（本类不写 `$winnerY`，SWF 默认 90）。"},{"line_number":85,"content":"`game_start_mc_44` 其它脚本帧：27/28 按 `$round` 播 `nummc` 的 `\"r1\"..\"r5\"`；55 派 `\"fight_in\"`（本类不听）；58 `\"fight\"`；200/201 把 `winnermc` 挪到 `$winnerX/$winnerY` 并写 `isPerfect`；210 把 `winnermc` 的 COMPLETE 转发出去。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：包 `qbar_mc`。主条显示 `FighterMain.qi`（0–300，三格），侧条 `fzqi`（0–100）满了播 `readymc`。脸是**辅助** `Assister.data`，不是出战角色。P2 `setDirect(-1)`。"},{"line_number":12,"content":"## SWF 槽（`qbar_mc`）"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightQiBarMode.md","matches":[{"line_number":18,"content":"- 因此 **当前构建里三种模式外观无区别**：气条永远在 `qbar_mc` 的 SWF 原位（底侧），BITMAP 下只是显示/隐藏。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/HitsUI.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：包 `hits_mc`。用 `MCNumber(hits_num_mc)` 显示连击数，走 SWF 标签 `fadin` / `update` / `fadout`。P1=`hits1` 会按数字宽度把整块往右推，避免多位数盖住左边。"},{"line_number":15,"content":"`hits_mc` 是 `ui_fight` 上的屏幕布局。本类 **不**调 `GameState.getGameSpriteGlobalPosition`。那条 API 给 `FightUI.getPlayerPos` 的 `player_pos_p1/p2` 用。部分总览把「hits 数字跟角色」写在本类上，与源码不符。"},{"line_number":17,"content":"`hits_mc` 帧脚本（`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hits_mc.as`）："},{"line_number":32,"content":"- `_orgPos`：构造时 `hits_mc` 的 x/y。只有 **实例名 `\"hits1\"`** 才按数字宽度改 `_mc.x`；`hits2` 不动块，只把数字本身左移。"},{"line_number":43,"content":"`_mc`=`hits_mc`（带 `ct`、`hitsmc`）。取 `hits_num_mc` Class，`new MCNumber(..., 0, 1, 35)` 放进 `_mc.ct`。记下 `_orgPos`。此时数字是 0 但 MC 帧 1 `visible=false`。"},{"line_number":47,"content":"有 `_txtmc` 则 try `ct.removeChild`。null `_txtmc`/`_mc`/`_orgPos`。`FightUI.destory` 稍后 `ui.removeChildren()` 会把 `hits_mc` 也摘掉。"}]}]},"locations":[]}
