ripts/cover_bgimg.as`"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-full/net/play5d/game/bvn/state/CreditsState.as","matches":[{"line_number":42,"content":"         var _loc3_:BitmapData = ResUtils.I.createBitmapData(ResUtils.I.common_ui,\"cover_bgimg\",GameConfig.GAME_SIZE.x,GameConfig.GAME_SIZE.y);"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md","matches":[{"line_number":21,"content":"| `common_ui` | `CONGRATULATIONS`=`mc_congratulations`；`logo_movie` / `mc_wzbtn` / `cover_bgimg` / `mc_win_all` / `select_arrow_mc` / `trans_mc` | `LogoState`、`MenuBtn`、`CongratulateState`、`CreditsState`、`GameOverState`、`SetBtnGroup`、`TransUI` |"},{"line_number":98,"content":"`new Cls(width, height)`，即 `BitmapData` 导出类的标准构造。失败 Class 空 → `null`。`CongratulateState` / `CreditsState` 用 `common_ui` 的 `\"cover_bgimg\"` 铺 800×600。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/CongratulateState.md","matches":[{"line_number":10,"content":"- **Callees**：`ResUtils` `cover_bgimg`、`mc_congratulations`（`ResUtils.CONGRATULATIONS`）、`\"mc_win_all\"`；`SoundCtrl.BGM(\"congratulation\")`；`GameRender`；`BitmapFontText` + `AssetManager.getFont(\"font1\")`；`GameData.I.score`；`SetBtnGroup` BACK；`GameEvent.dispatchEvent(\"GAME_PASS_ALL\")`；BACK → `MainGame.goLogo()`。"},{"line_number":40,"content":"2. `cover_bgimg` 铺满，`_bg.alpha = -1`（即全透明），addChild。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/CreditsState.md","matches":[{"line_number":10,"content":"- **Callees**：`SoundCtrl.BGM(\"back\")`；`ResUtils.createBitmapData(common_ui, \"cover_bgimg\", GAME_SIZE)`（PNG 约 804×604）；`GameInterface.instance.getCreadits`（接口拼写 **Creadits**）；本包 `GameInterfaceManager.getCreadits` 追加「游戏出品：5dplay / 发布支持：GreenHD」并自己建黄字 TextField，**不会返回 null**；`SetBtnGroup.setBtnData([{BACK}])`；BACK → `MainGame.goMenu()`。"},{"line_number":35,"content":"3. `cover_bgimg` BitmapData 铺满 `GAME_SIZE`，`addChild`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/decompiled/ui/loading/scripts/cover_bgimg.as","matches":[{"line_number":5,"content":"   [Embed(source=\"/_assets/105_cover_bgimg.png\")]"},{"line_number":6,"content":"   public dynamic class cover_bgimg extends BitmapData"},{"line_number":9,"content":"      public function cover_bgimg(param1:int = 804, param2:int = 604)"}]}]},"locations":[]}
