态字符串（L15–25）：`SETTING` `stg_set_ui`、`CONGRATULATIONS` `mc_congratulations`、`WINNER` `winner_stg_mc`、`TITLE` `stg_title`、`GAME_OVER` `stg_gameover_mc`、`SELECT` `stg_select`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/BVN-ANALYSIS.md","matches":[{"line_number":199,"content":"| `select` | `select_swf` | `stg_select` |"},{"line_number":201,"content":"| `setting` | `setting_swf` | `stg_set_ui` |"},{"line_number":458,"content":"   8 个 CWS15。改标题/选人/HUD 要保导出类名：`stg_title`、`stg_select`、`ui_fight` 等，否则 `ResUtils.createDisplayObject` 会炸。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-noload/net/play5d/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.as","matches":[{"line_number":15,"content":"      public static var SETTING:String = \"stg_set_ui\";"},{"line_number":25,"content":"      public static var SELECT:String = \"stg_select\";"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/interfaces/IInnerSetUI.md","matches":[{"line_number":21,"content":"进/出动画。`SetCtrlBtnUI`：0.3s TweenLite 把 `keyset_mc` 从屏幕底滑到 y=0（或滑回），完成后再开/关 `_btnGroup.keyEnable`。`SettingState` 用它们衔接主列表显隐。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-full-clean/net/play5d/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.as","matches":[{"line_number":15,"content":"      public static var SETTING:String = \"stg_set_ui\";"},{"line_number":25,"content":"      public static var SELECT:String = \"stg_select\";"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-noload/net/play5d/game/bvn/ui/select/SelecterItemUI.as","matches":[{"line_number":45,"content":"         ui = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select,\"select_item_mc\");"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-full/net/play5d/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.as","matches":[{"line_number":15,"content":"      public static var SETTING:String = \"stg_set_ui\";"},{"line_number":25,"content":"      public static var SELECT:String = \"stg_select\";"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/import-noload/net/play5d/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectedFighterUI.as","matches":[{"line_number":41,"content":"            if(param1 is selected_item_p1_mc)"},{"lin