GAME_OVER`=`stg_gameover_mc` | `GameOverState` |"},{"line_number":56,"content":"静态字符串（L15–25）：`SETTING` `stg_set_ui`、`CONGRATULATIONS` `mc_congratulations`、`WINNER` `winner_stg_mc`、`TITLE` `stg_title`、`GAME_OVER` `stg_gameover_mc`、`SELECT` `stg_select`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ctrl/SoundCtrl.md","matches":[{"line_number":12,"content":"  - 各 State 的 BGM：`MenuState(\"op\")`、`SelectFighterStage(\"select\")`、`LoadingState(\"loading\")`、`SettingState`/`HowToPlayState`/`CreditsState(\"back\")`、`GameOverState(\"continue\")`、`CongratulateState(\"congratulation\")`、`WinnerState` 先 `BGM(null)` 再 `playAssetSound(\"win\")` 后 `BGM(\"winloop\")`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/WinnerState.md","matches":[{"line_number":28,"content":"- `destory` 时间轴标签也叫 `\"destory\"`（拼写贯穿）。"},{"line_number":158,"content":"5. `_ui.gotoAndStop(\"destory\")` 后 `_ui=null`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/MenuState.md","matches":[{"line_number":18,"content":"- `stg_title` 时间轴：帧 50 / 帧 75 各 `stop` + `COMPLETE`；本类不听 complete，只 `gotoAndStop(1)` / `gotoAndPlay(2)` / `gotoAndPlay(\"menu\")`。"},{"line_number":57,"content":"2. `_ui.gotoAndPlay(\"menu\")`：切到菜单段。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/GameOverState.md","matches":[{"line_number":14,"content":"- **Callees**：`StateCtrl.clearTrans`；`ResUtils`（`gameover` SWF / `stg_gameover_mc` / `select_arrow_mc`）；`SoundCtrl`（BGM `continue`、`snd_gameover`、确认/选择音）；`AssetManager.getSound`/`getFont`；`GameInputer`（MENU 左右/select）；`GameRender.add/remove(render)`；`GameLogic.loseScoreByContinue`；`MainGame.goSelect` / `goLogo`；`GameEvent(\"GAME_OVER\")`；`GameCtrl.gameRunData.continueLoser` + `GameCtrl.destory`；`FighterMain`（**fighter，只作立绘**：scale/lose/idle/mc）；`setFrameOut`；`BitmapFontText`。"},{"line_number":20,"content":"- `stg_gameover_mc` 时间轴标签：`continue` / `continue_yes` / `continue_no` / `gameover`。自定义事件 `\"complete\"` 驱动阶段切换（不是 Event.COMPLETE 常量，是时间轴 `dispatchEvent`）。"},{"line_number":38,"content":"  showGameOver()                 // 可在同一实例上从 continue_no 接过来"},{"line_number":46,"content":"- `_ui:stg_gameover_mc`：gameover SWF 导出。"},{"line_number":56,"content":"`StateCtrl.I.clearTrans()`：进页前拆转场遮罩（其它 state 少这么做）。`ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.gameover, ResUtils.GAME_OVER)` → `stg_gameover_mc`，`gotoAndStop(1)`。**先于** `showContinue`/`showGameOver`，所以 `goStage` addChild 时 UI 已在。"},{"line_number":60,"content":"听 `\"complete\"` → `showContinueComplete`。`gotoAndPlay(\"continue\")`。`addChar()`。BGM `AssetManager.getSound(\"continue\")`。"},{"line_number":129,"content":"听 complete → `showContYesComplete`。`gotoAndPlay(\"continue_yes\")`。关键。`_char.idle()` 从失败姿势站起来。`removeArrow`。"},{"line_number":139,"content":"`continue_no` 动画，`removeArrow`。**不**立刻关 `_keyEnabled`（但箭头没了，`setArrow` 仍可能被 hover 调到——按钮监听还在）。complete → `showGameOver`。"},{"line_number":149,"content":"从 continue_no 过来时角色可能仍在 `ct_char`；时间轴切 gameover 后该槽或被换掉，`destory` 再拆 mc。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md","matches":[{"line_number":46,"content":"卸 COMPLETE，`gotoAndStop(\"destory\")`，`_ui=null`。有 `_faceBp` 则 `bitmapData.dispose()`。`_fighter=null`。不 destory Ins*。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/state/HowToPlayState.md","matches":[{"line_number":11,"content":"- **UI**：`movie_howtoplay` — 帧 1 `stop`，帧 1211 `stop` + `COMPLETE`；公开 `skip_btn` 与 `txt_up/down/left/right/attack/jump/dash/skill/bisha/special`。时间轴标签 `\"skip\"` / `\"destory\"` 只在 SWF 里，AS 导出类未见。"},{"line_number":15,"content":"- `destory` 拼写保留；时间轴也有同名标签 `\"destory\"`。"},{"line_number":39,"content":"`GameInputer.back(1)` **或** `GameInputer.select(\"MENU\", 1)` → 卸 render，`_ui.gotoAndPlay(\"skip\")`。skip 段播完仍应落到帧 1211 `COMPLETE`（时间轴约定，AS 未验证）。"},{"line_number":43,"content":"鼠标点 skip：同样卸 render + `gotoAndPlay(\"skip\")`。不在这里 `goSelect`，等 `complete`。"},{"line_number":59,"content":"`BGM(null)` 停背景；`GameRender.remove(render)`；卸 complete；`gotoAndStop(\"destory\")` 停在销毁帧。不卸 `skip_btn` 的 click。不调 `param1`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md","matches":[{"line_number":23,"content":"帧脚本：帧 1 `stop`；帧 25 / 46 `stop` + `Event.COMPLETE`（对应 `fadin_fin` / `fadout_fin` 一类标签）。`FightBar` 用标签名 `\"fadin\"` / `\"fadin_fin\"` / `\"fadout\"` / `\"destory\"`，具体帧号以 SWF 为准。"},{"line_number":97,"content":"1. 卸 `\"complete\"`，`_ui.gotoAndStop(\"destory\")`（SWF 清理帧，标签拼写同引擎），`_ui=null`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md","matches":[{"line_number":259,"content":"SWF 标签也是 `fadin` / `fadout`（无 e）。`FightBar` / `QiBar` 销毁帧标签叫 `\"destory\"`。"}]}]},"locations":[]}
