 ZIP 里 XML（deflate，要重算 local+CD 的 CRC/size）。改菜单皮肤：动 8 个 UI BinaryData（等长 CWS 可避免碰 FileLength）。改一护贴图：ZIP `assets/fighter/ichigo.swf` 或 `assets/face/ichigo*.png`。HTML/Ruffle **不会** 再按 URL 拉角色。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/GROK-SWF-REPORT.md","matches":[{"line_number":233,"content":"`ichigo` (frames 1–4: base / 卍解 / 半虚 / 虚化), `ichigo_zero` (1–3: 零段 / 内虚 / 内虚卍解), `rukia` + `rukia_shijie`, `renji`, `kenpachi`, `ikkaku`, `yin`, `chad`, `uryuu`, `toushirou` + `toushirou_wanjie`, `byakuya` + `byakuya_wanjie`, `ulquiorra` + `ulquiorra_guiren`, `aizen`, `mayuri`, `orihime`, `grimmjow`, `soifon`, `kenshin` + `kenshin_bdz`."},{"line_number":294,"content":"| 1 | 0 TEAM | Naruto fights Bleach cast | ichigo_xuhua 1.5, ulquiorra/yin 1.2, aizen 1.5/2 |"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/BVN-ANALYSIS.md","matches":[{"line_number":227,"content":"<fighter id=\"ichigo_wanjie\" name=\"黑崎·一护 卍解\" comic_type=\"0\">"},{"line_number":228,"content":"  <file url=\"assets/fighter/ichigo.swf\" startFrame=\"2\" />"},{"line_number":229,"content":"  <face url=\"assets/face/ichigo_wj.png\" … />"},{"line_number":233,"content":"同一份 SWF 用 `startFrame` 切皮肤（一护 1–4 段共用 `ichigo.swf`）。`GameLoader.loadFighter`："}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extracted/full/INVENTORY.md","matches":[{"line_number":133,"content":"    assets/bgm/ichigo.mp3"},{"line_number":190,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo.png"},{"line_number":191,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_b.png"},{"line_number":192,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_halfmask.png"},{"line_number":193,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_halfmask_b.png"},{"line_number":194,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_halfmask_m.png"},{"line_number":195,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_halfmask_w.png"},{"line_number":196,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_m.png"},{"line_number":197,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_neixu_m.png"},{"line_number":198,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_neixu_w.png"},{"line_number":199,"content":"    assets/face/ichigo_padipata.png"},{"line_number":200,"c