"line_number":24,"content":"| `transIn` / `transOut` | 对玩家：In=变黑/盖住，Out=揭开。对应 `TransUI.fadIn`/`fadOut` 标签 `fadin`/`fadout` |"},{"line_number":63,"content":"`TransUI.fadIn`：`gotoAndStop(\"fadin\")`，每动画帧 `nextFrame`，直到 label `\"stop\"` 调 callback。动画速率跟 `MainGame.getFPS()/30` 对齐。"},{"line_number":73,"content":"`GameStartCtrl` 显式 `true`。若上一层 transIn 已经卸掉 UI，这里 `addTransUI` 会重新挂上再播 fadout —— 可能闪一帧遮罩。正常配对是 In 不卸、Out 才卸。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/SetCtrlBtnUI.md","matches":[{"line_number":165,"content":"与主列表的配合：主列表同时 0.2s tween 到 `y = -GAME_SIZE.y` 后 `visible=false`，并立刻 `keyEnable=false`。内页从底下盖上来。`_man.gotoAndPlay(\"key_fadin\")` 是 Setting 里一护立绘，不在本类。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md","matches":[{"line_number":21,"content":"帧脚本：帧 1 `stop`；帧 15 / 38 `stop`+`COMPLETE`（fadin_fin / fadout_fin）。"},{"line_number":32,"content":"- BITMAP 构造即 `gotoAndStop(\"fadin_fin\"); visible=false`。`fadIn` 只 `visible=true`，无淡入。"},{"line_number":42,"content":"`_bar=new InsBar(_ui.barmc)`，`_fzBar=new InsFzBar(_ui.fzqibar)`，`_fzReadyMc=_ui.readymc`。记下 `_orgPose`。听 `\"complete\"`。BITMAP：停在 `fadin_fin` 并隐藏。"},{"line_number":80,"content":"与 `FightBar.renderAnimate` 同构：`_isRenderAnimate` 闸，标签 `fadin_fin`/`fadout_fin` 关闸，否则 `nextFrame()`。BITMAP 从不置闸。"},{"line_number":84,"content":"已显示 return。`_isFadIn=true`，`visible=true`。BITMAP 立刻 return（已在 fadin_fin）。否则 `param1` 真：关 cache、`\"fadin\"`、开动画；假：`\"fadin_fin\"` + 开 cache。"},{"line_number":90,"content":"未显示 return。`_isFadIn=false`。BITMAP：`visible=false` return。否则带动画则 `\"fadout\"`+关 cache；否则直接 `visible=false`。"}]},{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/HitsUI.md","matches":[{"line_number":3,"content":"一句话目的：包 `hits_mc`。用 `MCNumber(hits_num_mc)` 显示连击数，走 SWF 标签 `fadin` / `update` / `fadout`。P1=`hits1` 会按数字宽度把整块往右推，避免多位数盖住左边。"},{"line_number":22,"content":"| 10 | `visible=true`（fadin 中途显） |"},{"line_number":23,"content":"| 20 | `stop`（fadin 完） |"},{"line_number":25,"content":"| 56 | `gotoAndStop(1)`（fadout 完回隐） |"},{"line_number":27,"content":"`gotoAndPlay(\"fadin\"|\"update\"|\"fadout\")` 靠 Flash 时间轴自己跑，**不**经 `FightUI.renderAnimate`。"},{"line_number":36,"content":"- 已显示再 `show` 走 `\"update\"` 弹一下，不重播 fadin。"},{"line_number":37,"content":"- `hide` 不关 `_txtmc`，fadout 播完 SWF 自己 `gotoAndStop(1)` 藏。"},{"line_number":55,"content":"5. 否则 `_isShow=true`，`gotoAndPlay(\"fadin\")`。"}]}]},"locations":[]}
