{"type":"thought","data":" The frame scripts at 49, 85, 124, and 238 line up perfectly with the end of each animation segment, and the sequential structure you described (continue → continue_yes → continue_no → gameover) matches how Flash timelines typically handle these UI flows even when the branches aren't played in sequence during gameplay."}
