Animate` 见标签 `fadin_fin` 会关 `_isRenderAnimate`，停在完成帧等这条 COMPLETE。\n\n### `frame46`（L47–51）—— F46\n\n同样 `stop` + `COMPLETE`。淡出走完。`uiPlayComplete` 因 `_isFadIn==false` 把 `visible=false`。对应 `fadout_fin`。\n\n`fadOut(false)`（`GameEndCtrl` 终场）不播这段，直接 `visible=false`。BITMAP 的 fadIn/fadOut 只改 `_children.visible`，这两条脚本基本不再触发。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-655df40d-d229-4628-8a9b-f568f5fec362-78","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facegroup.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `hpbar_facegroup` — 一侧三槽头像\n\n一句话目的：出战大脸 + 两名候补。SWF 三个 `hpbar_facemc` 槽；谁在大槽由当前出战角色决定。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facegroup.as`（21 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.face1` / `face2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new FightFaceGroup(_ui.face1/face2)`；P2 `setDirect(-1)`。\n\n[`FightFaceGroup`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceGroup.md)：\n\n| 实例 | 槽 |\n|---|---|\n| `face` | 出战大脸 → `_face1` |\n| `face2` | 候补 1（SWF 更小）→ `_face2` |\n| `face3` | 候补 2 → `_face3` |\n\n`setFighter(GameRunFighterGroup)`：`currentFighter==fighter1` 则候补是 2/3；`fighter2` 则候补只剩 3；`fighter3` 两大槽都 `setData(null)` 隐藏。单挑只有 `fighter1` 时 `face2`/`face3` 藏。\n\nBITMAP：脸留在 `hpbar_mc` 子树，烤进 FightBar 底图；`setFighter` 后 `updateBitmap()`。`cacheAsBitmap` 由引擎在 group 上开关，不是本 AS。\n\n`FightFaceUI.setDirect` 空函数。P2 镜像靠 SWF 里 `face2` 组已 `scaleX=-1` / 右对齐。?\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol118\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_facegroup extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `face`**：[`hpbar_facemc`](hpbar_facemc.md)。出战大槽。\n- **L11 `face2`**：同类型。候补槽 1。\n- **L13 `face3`**：候补槽 2。\n- **L15–18 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。槽位规则全在引擎。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `hpbar_facegroup` — 一侧三槽头像\n\n一句话目的：出战大脸 + 两名候补。SWF 三个 `hpbar_facemc` 槽；谁在大槽由当前出战角色决定。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facegroup.as`（21 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.face1` / `face2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new FightFaceGroup(_ui.face1/face2)`；P2 `setDirect(-1)`。\n\n[`FightFaceGroup`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceGroup.md)：\n\n| 实例 | 槽 |\n|---|---|\n| `face` | 出战大脸 → `_face1` |\n| `face2` | 候补 1（SWF 更小）→ `_face2` |\n| `face3` | 候补 2 → `_face3` |\n\n`setFighter(GameRunFighterGroup)`：`currentFighter==fighter1` 则候补是 2/3；`fighter2` 则候补只剩 3；`fighter3` 两大槽都 `setData(null)` 隐藏。单挑只有 `fighter1` 时 `face2`/`face3` 藏。\n\nBITMAP：脸留在 `hpbar_mc` 子树，烤进 FightBar 底图；`setFighter` 后 `updateBitmap()`。`cacheAsBitmap` 由引擎在 group 上开关，不是本 AS。\n\n`FightFaceUI.setDirect` 空函数。P2 镜像靠 SWF 里 `face2` 组已 `scaleX=-1` / 右对齐。?\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol118\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_facegroup extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `face`**：[`hpbar_facemc`](hpbar_facemc.md)。出战大槽。\n- **L11 `face2`**：同类型。候补槽 1。\n- **L13 `face3`**：候补槽 2。\n- **L15–18 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。槽位规则全在引擎。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `hpbar_facegroup` — 一侧三槽头像\n\n一句话目的：出战大脸 + 两名候补。SWF 三个 `hpbar_facemc` 槽；谁在大槽由当前出战角色决定。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facegroup.as`（21 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.face1` / `face2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new FightFaceGroup(_ui.face1/face2)`；P2 `setDirect(-1)`。\n\n[`FightFaceGroup`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceGroup.md)：\n\n| 实例 | 槽 |\n|---|---|\n| `face` | 出战大脸 → `_face1` |\n| `face2` | 候补 1（SWF 更小）→ `_face2` |\n| `face3` | 候补 2 → `_face3` |\n\n`setFighter(GameRunFighterGroup)`：`currentFighter==fighter1` 则候补是 2/3；`fighter2` 则候补只剩 3；`fighter3` 两大槽都 `setData(null)` 隐藏。单挑只有 `fighter1` 时 `face2`/`face3` 藏。\n\nBITMAP：脸留在 `hpbar_mc` 子树，烤进 FightBar 底图；`setFighter` 后 `updateBitmap()`。`cacheAsBitmap` 由引擎在 group 上开关，不是本 AS。\n\n`FightFaceUI.setDirect` 空函数。P2 镜像靠 SWF 里 `face2` 组已 `scaleX=-1` / 右对齐。?\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol118\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_facegroup extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `face`**：[`hpbar_facemc`](hpbar_facemc.md)。出战大槽。\n- **L11 `face2`**：同类型。候补槽 1。\n- **L13 `face3`**：候补槽 2。\n- **L15–18 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。槽位规则全在引擎。\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-li