{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-655df40d-d229-4628-8a9b-f568f5fec362-77","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `hpbar_barmc` — 单侧 HP 条（绿当前 + 红拖尾）\n\n一句话目的：一条血的两个条子。`bar` 跟当前 HP，`redbar` 是受击后慢追上的缺口。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.bar1` / `bar2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) 构造 `new FighterHpBar(_ui.bar1/bar2)`。\n\n[`FighterHpBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FighterHpBar.md)：`_bar=_ui.bar`，`_redbar=_ui.redbar`。每逻辑帧改 **`scaleX`**（满血默认 1）。绿条掉血系数 0.4、回血 0.04；红条 delay 后再 0.1 / 0.02。P2 的 `bar2` SWF 已朝左，本类和引擎都不 `scaleX*=-1`。\n\nBITMAP：整块 `hpbar_barmc` 从本父级抬到 `ui_fight`，不烤进底图。\n\n无帧脚本。条子内部若还有嵌套 MC，引擎当 `DisplayObject` 只缩 `scaleX`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol112\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_barmc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `bar`**：`MovieClip`。当前 HP（绿/前景）。`FighterHpBar.render` lerp `scaleX`。\n- **L11 `redbar`**：`MovieClip`。拖尾。受击 `HURT_ING`(21) delay 写死 100 帧；击飞/倒地再等 `1.5*FPS_GAME`。新伤害且红条在动会先 snap 到旧比率。\n- **L13–16 构造**：只 `super()`。无 `addFrameScript`、无公开方法。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `hpbar_barmc` — 单侧 HP 条（绿当前 + 红拖尾）\n\n一句话目的：一条血的两个条子。`bar` 跟当前 HP，`redbar` 是受击后慢追上的缺口。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.bar1` / `bar2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) 构造 `new FighterHpBar(_ui.bar1/bar2)`。\n\n[`FighterHpBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FighterHpBar.md)：`_bar=_ui.bar`，`_redbar=_ui.redbar`。每逻辑帧改 **`scaleX`**（满血默认 1）。绿条掉血系数 0.4、回血 0.04；红条 delay 后再 0.1 / 0.02。P2 的 `bar2` SWF 已朝左，本类和引擎都不 `scaleX*=-1`。\n\nBITMAP：整块 `hpbar_barmc` 从本父级抬到 `ui_fight`，不烤进底图。\n\n无帧脚本。条子内部若还有嵌套 MC，引擎当 `DisplayObject` 只缩 `scaleX`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol112\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_barmc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `bar`**：`MovieClip`。当前 HP（绿/前景）。`FighterHpBar.render` lerp `scaleX`。\n- **L11 `redbar`**：`MovieClip`。拖尾。受击 `HURT_ING`(21) delay 写死 100 帧；击飞/倒地再等 `1.5*FPS_GAME`。新伤害且红条在动会先 snap 到旧比率。\n- **L13–16 构造**：只 `super()`。无 `addFrameScript`、无公开方法。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `hpbar_barmc` — 单侧 HP 条（绿当前 + 红拖尾）\n\n一句话目的：一条血的两个条子。`bar` 跟当前 HP，`redbar` 是受击后慢追上的缺口。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.bar1` / `bar2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) 构造 `new FighterHpBar(_ui.bar1/bar2)`。\n\n[`FighterHpBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FighterHpBar.md)：`_bar=_ui.bar`，`_redbar=_ui.redbar`。每逻辑帧改 **`scaleX`**（满血默认 1）。绿条掉血系数 0.4、回血 0.04；红条 delay 后再 0.1 / 0.02。P2 的 `bar2` SWF 已朝左，本类和引擎都不 `scaleX*=-1`。\n\nBITMAP：整块 `hpbar_barmc` 从本父级抬到 `ui_fight`，不烤进底图。\n\n无帧脚本。条子内部若还有嵌套 MC，引擎当 `DisplayObject` 只缩 `scaleX`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol112\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_barmc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `bar`**：`MovieClip`。当前 HP（绿/前景）。`FighterHpBar.render` lerp `scaleX`。\n- **L11 `redbar`**：`MovieClip`。拖尾。受击 `HURT_ING`(21) delay 写死 100 帧；击飞/倒地再等 `1.5*FPS_GAME`。新伤害且红条在动会先 snap 到旧比率。\n- **L13–16 构造**：只 `super()`。无 `addFrameScript`、无公开方法。\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.md has been created.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.md has been created.","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.md","edits":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `hpbar_barmc` — 单侧 HP 条（绿当前 + 红拖尾）\n\n一句话目的：一条血的两个条子。`bar` 跟当前 HP，`redbar` 是受击后慢追上的缺口。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_barmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.bar1` / `bar2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) 构造 `new FighterHpBar(_ui.bar1/bar2)`。\n\n[`FighterHpBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FighterHpBar.md)：`_bar=_ui.bar`，`_redbar=_ui.redbar`。每逻辑帧改 **`scaleX`**（满血默认 1）。绿条掉血系数 0.4、回血 0.04；红条 delay 后再 0.1 / 0.02。P2 的 `bar2` SWF 已朝左，本类和引擎都不 `scaleX*=-1`。\n\nBITMAP：整块 `hpbar_barmc` 从本父级抬到 `ui_fight`，不烤进底图。\n\n无帧脚本。条子内部若还有嵌套 MC，引擎当 `DisplayObject` 只缩 `scaleX`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol112\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_barmc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `bar`**：`MovieClip`。当前 HP（绿/前景）。`FighterHpBar.render` lerp `scaleX`。\n- **L11 `redbar`**：`MovieClip`。拖尾。受击 `HURT_ING`(21) delay 写死 100 帧；击飞/倒地再等 `1.5*FPS_GAME`。新伤害且红条在动会先 snap 到旧比率。\n- **L13–16 构造**：只 `super()`。无 `addFrameScript`、无公开方法。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-655df40d-d229-4628-8a9b-f568f5fec362-79","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `hpbar_facemc` — 单张血条头像槽\n\n一句话目的：一个头像坑。`ct` 是容器；引擎把 102×64 的 bar 脸 Bitmap 塞进去。空槽则整块隐藏。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_facegroup.face` / `face2` / `face3`](hpbar_facegroup.md) 各一颗。[`FightFaceGroup`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceGroup.md) `new FightFaceUI` 绑本类。\n\n[`FightFaceUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceUI.md) `setData(FighterVO|null)`：\n\n- null → `_ui.visible=false`（候补空槽）。\n- 有 VO → `visible=true`，`AssetManager.I.getFighterFaceBar`（默认 `Point(102,64)`）非 null 则 **`ct.addChild`**。从不 `removeChild`，换人叠脸。?\n- `setDirect` **空函数**。P2 翻脸没写。\n\n本类无 `destory`。脸图失败则 `ct` 空，露出 SWF 底图。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol117\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_facemc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `ct`**：`MovieClip`。唯一公开槽。引擎只往这里加 Bitmap，不改本 MC 的 `scaleX`。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `hpbar_facemc` — 单张血条头像槽\n\n一句话目的：一个头像坑。`ct` 是容器；引擎把 102×64 的 bar 脸 Bitmap 塞进去。空槽则整块隐藏。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_facegroup.face` / `face2` / `face3`](hpbar_facegroup.md) 各一颗。[`FightFaceGroup`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceGroup.md) `new FightFaceUI` 绑本类。\n\n[`FightFaceUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceUI.md) `setData(FighterVO|null)`：\n\n- null → `_ui.visible=false`（候补空槽）。\n- 有 VO → `visible=true`，`AssetManager.I.getFighterFaceBar`（默认 `Point(102,64)`）非 null 则 **`ct.addChild`**。从不 `removeChild`，换人叠脸。?\n- `setDirect` **空函数**。P2 翻脸没写。\n\n本类无 `destory`。脸图失败则 `ct` 空，露出 SWF 底图。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol117\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_facemc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `ct`**：`MovieClip`。唯一公开槽。引擎只往这里加 Bitmap，不改本 MC 的 `scaleX`。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `hpbar_facemc` — 单张血条头像槽\n\n一句话目的：一个头像坑。`ct` 是容器；引擎把 102×64 的 bar 脸 Bitmap 塞进去。空槽则整块隐藏。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_facegroup.face` / `face2` / `face3`](hpbar_facegroup.md) 各一颗。[`FightFaceGroup`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceGroup.md) `new FightFaceUI` 绑本类。\n\n[`FightFaceUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceUI.md) `setData(FighterVO|null)`：\n\n- null → `_ui.visible=false`（候补空槽）。\n- 有 VO → `visible=true`，`AssetManager.I.getFighterFaceBar`（默认 `Point(102,64)`）非 null 则 **`ct.addChild`**。从不 `removeChild`，换人叠脸。?\n- `setDirect` **空函数**。P2 翻脸没写。\n\n本类无 `destory`。脸图失败则 `ct` 空，露出 SWF 底图。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol117\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_facemc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `ct`**：`MovieClip`。唯一公开槽。引擎只往这里加 Bitmap，不改本 MC 的 `scaleX`。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.md has been created.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.md has been created.","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.md","edits":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `hpbar_facemc` — 单张血条头像槽\n\n一句话目的：一个头像坑。`ct` 是容器；引擎把 102×64 的 bar 脸 Bitmap 塞进去。空槽则整块隐藏。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/hpbar_facemc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_facegroup.face` / `face2` / `face3`](hpbar_facegroup.md) 各一颗。[`FightFaceGroup`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceGroup.md) `new FightFaceUI` 绑本类。\n\n[`FightFaceUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightFaceUI.md) `setData(FighterVO|null)`：\n\n- null → `_ui.visible=false`（候补空槽）。\n- 有 VO → `visible=true`，`AssetManager.I.getFighterFaceBar`（默认 `Point(102,64)`）非 null 则 **`ct.addChild`**。从不 `removeChild`，换人叠脸。?\n- `setDirect` **空函数**。P2 翻脸没写。\n\n本类无 `destory`。脸图失败则 `ct` 空，露出 SWF 底图。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol117\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class hpbar_facemc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `ct`**：`MovieClip`。唯一公开槽。引擎只往这里加 Bitmap，不改本 MC 的 `scaleX`。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-655df40d-d229-4628-8a9b-f568f5fec362-75","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/ui_fight.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `ui_fight` — 战斗 HUD 根 MC\n\n一句话目的：`ResUtils.I.fight` 的主导出。时间轴上排好顶栏血条、两侧气条、连击数字和开场/KO 片；引擎 `FightUI` 再往上加屏外标记和暂停框。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/ui_fight.as`（26 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`ResUtils`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md) 字段 `fight`（嵌入 `fight_swf$…`）。[`FightUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 构造 L64：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.fight, \"ui_fight\")\n```\n\n返回本类实例，赋给 `FightUI.ui`，`GameState` 把它 `addChild` 到镜头层外面（屏幕 800×600）。**不**走 `ResUtils` 常量表。\n\n构造后立刻拆子件：\n\n| 实例 | 类型 | 引擎包装 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `hpbarmc` | [`hpbar_mc`](hpbar_mc.md) | [`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) |\n| `fzqi1` / `fzqi2` | `qbar_mc` | [`QiBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)×2；P2 `setDirect(-1)` |\n| `hits1` / `hits2` | `hits_mc` | [`HitsUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/HitsUI.md)×2 |\n| `startKOmc` | `MovieClip` | 运行时是 `fight_fla.game_start_mc_44`。`showStart` / `showEnd` `gotoAndStop` 标签，[`FightUI.renderStartAndKO`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) `nextFrame()` |\n\n另：`createDisplayObject(\"player_pos_p1\"|\"player_pos_p2\")` 后 `ui.addChild`——**不是**本类字段，见 [`player_pos_p1`](player_pos_p1.md) / [`player_pos_p2`](player_pos_p2.md)。`PauseDialog` 也是代码加的。\n\nBITMAP 路径下 `FightBar` 会把 `hpbarmc` 从本 MC 摘掉，HP/体力/计时数字抬到本根下。`destory` 时 `ui.removeChildren()` + `stopAllMovieClips()`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1–3** 无名包。`import flash.display.MovieClip`。\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol195\")]`。FFDec 从 fight SWF 抽的链接。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class ui_fight extends MovieClip`。动态类：时间轴实例名靠运行时绑定。\n- **L9–10 `fzqi1` / `fzqi2`**：`qbar_mc`。底侧气条 + 辅助气 + 辅助脸。P1 左、P2 右。\n- **L13–14 `hits1` / `hits2`**：`hits_mc`。屏幕固定位连击数字，不跟角色。\n- **L17 `hpbarmc`**：[`hpbar_mc`](hpbar_mc.md)。整条顶栏（脸 / HP / 体力 / 计时 / 胜场灯 / 分数）。\n- **L19 `startKOmc`**：声明成 `MovieClip`，不是导出类名。SWF 里挂的是 `fight_fla.game_start_mc_44`（`$round` / `$perfect` / `$winnerX`）。`FightUI.clearStartAndEnd` → `gotoAndStop(1)`。\n- **L21–24 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本、无 `stop`。时间轴默认停在 SWF 第 1 帧（布局帧）。\n- **没有** `player_pos_*`、`txt_mc`、暂停框字段。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `ui_fight` — 战斗 HUD 根 MC\n\n一句话目的：`ResUtils.I.fight` 的主导出。时间轴上排好顶栏血条、两侧气条、连击数字和开场/KO 片；引擎 `FightUI` 再往上加屏外标记和暂停框。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/ui_fight.as`（26 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`ResUtils`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md) 字段 `fight`（嵌入 `fight_swf$…`）。[`FightUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 构造 L64：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.fight, \"ui_fight\")\n```\n\n返回本类实例，赋给 `FightUI.ui`，`GameState` 把它 `addChild` 到镜头层外面（屏幕 800×600）。**不**走 `ResUtils` 常量表。\n\n构造后立刻拆子件：\n\n| 实例 | 类型 | 引擎包装 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `hpbarmc` | [`hpbar_mc`](hpbar_mc.md) | [`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) |\n| `fzqi1` / `fzqi2` | `qbar_mc` | [`QiBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)×2；P2 `setDirect(-1)` |\n| `hits1` / `hits2` | `hits_mc` | [`HitsUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/HitsUI.md)×2 |\n| `startKOmc` | `MovieClip` | 运行时是 `fight_fla.game_start_mc_44`。`showStart` / `showEnd` `gotoAndStop` 标签，[`FightUI.renderStartAndKO`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) `nextFrame()` |\n\n另：`createDisplayObject(\"player_pos_p1\"|\"player_pos_p2\")` 后 `ui.addChild`——**不是**本类字段，见 [`player_pos_p1`](player_pos_p1.md) / [`player_pos_p2`](player_pos_p2.md)。`PauseDialog` 也是代码加的。\n\nBITMAP 路径下 `FightBar` 会把 `hpbarmc` 从本 MC 摘掉，HP/体力/计时数字抬到本根下。`destory` 时 `ui.removeChildren()` + `stopAllMovieClips()`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1–3** 无名包。`import flash.display.MovieClip`。\n- **L5** `[Embed(source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol195\")]`。FFDec 从 fight SWF 抽的链接。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class ui_fight extends MovieClip`。动态类：时间轴实例名靠运行时绑定。\n- **L9–10 `fzqi1` / `fzqi2`**：`qbar_mc`。底侧气条 + 辅助气 + 辅助脸。P1 左、P2 右。\n- **L13–14 `hits1` / `hits2`**：`hits_mc`。屏幕固定位连击数字，不跟角色。\n- **L17 `hpbarmc`**：[`hpbar_mc`](hpbar_mc.md)。整条顶栏（脸 / HP / 体力 / 计时 / 胜场灯 / 分数）。\n- **L19 `startKOmc`**：声明成 `MovieClip`，不是导出类名。SWF 里挂的是 `fight_fla.game_start_mc_44`（`$round` / `$perfect` / `$winnerX`）。`FightUI.clearStartAndEnd` → `gotoAndStop(1)`。\n- **L21–24 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本、无 `stop`。时间轴默认停在 SWF 第 1 帧（布局帧）。\n- **没有** `player_pos_*`、`txt_mc`、暂停框字段。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `ui_fight` — 战斗 HUD 根 MC\n\n一句话目的：`ResUtils.I.fight` 的主导出。时间轴上排好顶栏血条、两侧气条、连击数字和开场/KO 片；引擎 `FightUI` 再往上加屏外标记和暂停框。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/ui_fight.as`（26 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`ResUtils`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md) 字段 `fight`（嵌入 `fight_swf$…`）。[`FightUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) 构造 L64：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.fight, \"ui_fight\")\n```\n\n返回本类实例，赋给 `FightUI.ui`，`GameState` 把它 `addChild` 到镜头层外面（屏幕 800×600）。**不**走 `ResUtils` 常量表。\n\n构造后立刻拆子件：\n\n| 实例 | 类型 | 引擎包装 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `hpbarmc` | [`hpbar_mc`](hpbar_mc.md) | [`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) |\n| `fzqi1` / `fzqi2` | `qbar_mc` | [`QiBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)×2；P2 `setDirect(-1)` |\n| `hits1` / `hits2` | `hits_mc` | [`HitsUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/HitsUI.md)×2 |\n| `startKOmc` | `MovieClip` | 运行时是 `fight_fla.game_start_mc_44`。`showStart` / `showEnd` `gotoAndStop` 标签，[`FightUI.renderStartAndKO`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightUI.md) `nextFrame()` |\n\n另：`createDisplayObject(\"player_pos_p1\"|\"player_pos_p2\")` 后 `ui.addChild`——**不是**本类字段，见 [`player_pos_p1`](player_pos_p1.md) / [`player_pos_p2`](player_pos_p2.md)。`PauseDialog` 也是代码加的。\n\nBITMAP 路径下 `FightBar` 会把 `hpbarmc` 从本 MC 摘掉，HP/体力/计时数字抬到本根下。`destory` 时