{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe shape breakdown you laid out is solid:\n- shape 2 (3474×600, fill 0x43, bitmap 1 JPEG3) = trans wipe\n- shape 4 (800×600, bitmap 3 JPEG) = full-cover black/alpha\n- shape 7 arrow (34×37)\n- wzbtn bg shapes (388×75, bitmaps 9/11)\n- logo graphic (353×226, bitmap 18)\n- congratulations (750×93, 21)\n- small vector spark (139×105)\n\nAnd the timeline notes line up nicely:\n- logo_movie 66 frames @ 30 fps → 2."}
