{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-4a33753e-ed54-4b8b-bca5-392c252ddf5c-72","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `(无名包).select_arrow_mc_1` — P1 出战顺序箭头（空 MC）\n\n一句话目的：战前出战顺序 UI 里 P1 那侧的光标箭头。AS 空壳，图形全在 FLA。本批导出在 loading.swf；引擎向 `select` 按名取。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`SelectIndexUI.initP1Group`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) L138–139：\n\n```\nvar arrow:DisplayObject = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select, \"select_arrow_mc_1\");\n_p1Group.initArrow(arrow, new Point(-10, 30));\n```\n\n偏移 `(-10, 30)`：相对第一张人物条，箭头在左侧。P2 对称件是 [`select_arrow_mc_2`](./select_arrow_mc_2.md)（偏移 `(260, 30)`）。\n\n只在组队模式 10/11/12 建箭头；单挑 / 生存 / 训练 `initSelect` default 两边直接 `isFinish`，不 `createDisplayObject`。\n\n**库名对不上**：反编译在 `ui/loading/`。引擎第一参 `ResUtils.I.select`。本批 `decompiled/ui/select/` **没有** `select_arrow_mc_1`（select.swf 也可能另有同名导出，本批未见）。能取到是因为 [`ResUtils`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md) 八 SWF 并入 `ApplicationDomain.currentDomain`，`getDefinition` 按链接名。\n\n不要和 `common_ui` 的 `select_arrow_mc`（无 `_1`）搞混：那是设置页 / GameOver 菜单箭头。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1–3**：无名包。`MovieClip`。\n- **L5**：`[Embed(..., symbol=\"symbol76\")]`。\n- **L6**：`public dynamic class select_arrow_mc_1 extends MovieClip`。无 public 字段。\n- **L9–12 构造**：`super()`。无 `addFrameScript`。空逻辑类，显示靠时间轴图形。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `(无名包).select_arrow_mc_1` — P1 出战顺序箭头（空 MC）\n\n一句话目的：战前出战顺序 UI 里 P1 那侧的光标箭头。AS 空壳，图形全在 FLA。本批导出在 loading.swf；引擎向 `select` 按名取。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`SelectIndexUI.initP1Group`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) L138–139：\n\n```\nvar arrow:DisplayObject = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select, \"select_arrow_mc_1\");\n_p1Group.initArrow(arrow, new Point(-10, 30));\n```\n\n偏移 `(-10, 30)`：相对第一张人物条，箭头在左侧。P2 对称件是 [`select_arrow_mc_2`](./select_arrow_mc_2.md)（偏移 `(260, 30)`）。\n\n只在组队模式 10/11/12 建箭头；单挑 / 生存 / 训练 `initSelect` default 两边直接 `isFinish`，不 `createDisplayObject`。\n\n**库名对不上**：反编译在 `ui/loading/`。引擎第一参 `ResUtils.I.select`。本批 `decompiled/ui/select/` **没有** `select_arrow_mc_1`（select.swf 也可能另有同名导出，本批未见）。能取到是因为 [`ResUtils`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md) 八 SWF 并入 `ApplicationDomain.currentDomain`，`getDefinition` 按链接名。\n\n不要和 `common_ui` 的 `select_arrow_mc`（无 `_1`）搞混：那是设置页 / GameOver 菜单箭头。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1–3**：无名包。`MovieClip`。\n- **L5**：`[Embed(..., symbol=\"symbol76\")]`。\n- **L6**：`public dynamic class select_arrow_mc_1 extends MovieClip`。无 public 字段。\n- **L9–12 构造**：`super()`。无 `addFrameScript`。空逻辑类，显示靠时间轴图形。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `(无名包).select_arrow_mc_1` — P1 出战顺序箭头（空 MC）\n\n一句话目的：战前出战顺序 UI 里 P1 那侧的光标箭头。AS 空壳，图形全在 FLA。本批导出在 loading.swf；引擎向 `select` 按名取。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`SelectIndexUI.initP1Group`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) L138–139：\n\n```\nvar arrow:DisplayObject = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select, \"select_arrow_mc_1\");\n_p1Group.initArrow(arrow, new Point(-10, 30));\n```\n\n偏移 `(-10, 30)`：相对第一张人物条，箭头在左侧。P2 对称件是 [`select_arrow_mc_2`](./select_arrow_mc_2.md)（偏移 `(260, 30)`）。\n\n只在组队模式 10/11/12 建箭头；单挑 / 生存 / 训练 `initSelect` default 两边直接 `isFinish`，不 `createDisplayObject`。\n\n**库名对不上**：反编译在 `ui/loading/`。引擎第一参 `ResUtils.I.select`。本批 `decompiled/ui/select/` **没有** `select_arrow_mc_1`（select.swf 也可能另有同名导出，本批未见）。能取到是因为 [`ResUtils`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md) 八 SWF 并入 `ApplicationDomain.currentDomain`，`getDefinition` 按链接名。\n\n不要和 `common_ui` 的 `select_arrow_mc`（无 `_1`）搞混：那是设置页 / GameOver 菜单箭头。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1–3**：无名包。`MovieClip`。\n- **L5**：`[Embed(..., symbol=\"symbol76\")]`。\n- **L6**：`public dynamic class select_arrow_mc_1 extends MovieClip`。无 public 字段。\n- **L9–12 构造**：`super()`。无 `addFrameScript`。空逻辑类，显示靠时间轴图形。\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.md has been created.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.md has been created.","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.md","edits":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `(无名包).select_arrow_mc_1` — P1 出战顺序箭头（空 MC）\n\n一句话目的：战前出战顺序 UI 里 P1 那侧的光标箭头。AS 空壳，图形全在 FLA。本批导出在 loading.swf；引擎向 `select` 按名取。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_1.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`SelectIndexUI.initP1Group`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) L138–139：\n\n```\nvar arrow:DisplayObject = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select, \"select_arrow_mc_1\");\n_p1Group.initArrow(arrow, new Point(-10, 30));\n```\n\n偏移 `(-10, 30)`：相对第一张人物条，箭头在左侧。P2 对称件是 [`select_arrow_mc_2`](./select_arrow_mc_2.md)（偏移 `(260, 30)`）。\n\n只在组队模式 10/11/12 建箭头；单挑 / 生存 / 训练 `initSelect` default 两边直接 `isFinish`，不 `createDisplayObject`。\n\n**库名对不上**：反编译在 `ui/loading/`。引擎第一参 `ResUtils.I.select`。本批 `decompiled/ui/select/` **没有** `select_arrow_mc_1`（select.swf 也可能另有同名导出，本批未见）。能取到是因为 [`ResUtils`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md) 八 SWF 并入 `ApplicationDomain.currentDomain`，`getDefinition` 按链接名。\n\n不要和 `common_ui` 的 `select_arrow_mc`（无 `_1`）搞混：那是设置页 / GameOver 菜单箭头。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1–3**：无名包。`MovieClip`。\n- **L5**：`[Embed(..., symbol=\"symbol76\")]`。\n- **L6**：`public dynamic class select_arrow_mc_1 extends MovieClip`。无 public 字段。\n- **L9–12 构造**：`super()`。无 `addFrameScript`。空逻辑类，显示靠时间轴图形。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-4a33753e-ed54-4b8b-bca5-392c252ddf5c-73","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_2.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `(无名包).select_arrow_mc_2` — P2 出战顺序箭头（空 MC）\n\n一句话目的：战前出战顺序 UI 里 P2 那侧的光标箭头。AS 空壳。本批导出在 loading.swf；引擎向 `select` 按名取。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_2.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`SelectIndexUI.initP2Group`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) L158–159：\n\n```\nvar _loc3_:DisplayObject = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select, \"select_arrow_mc_2\");\n_p2Group.initArrow(_loc3_, new Point(260, 30));\n```\n\n偏移 `(260, 30)`：P2 卡片朝右，箭头在条右侧。P1 对称件 [`select_arrow_mc_1`](./select_arrow_mc_1.md) 偏移 `(-10, 30)`。\n\n`initP2Group` 在模式 10（P2 `autoSelect`）、11（键 `\"P2\"`）、12（P1 完后再键 `\"P1\"`）都会建。default 模式不进这里。\n\n**库名对不上**：同 `_1`——类在 loading.swf，[`ResUtils.createDisplayObject`](../../../engine/game/bvn/utils/ResUtils.md)`(ResUtils.I.select, \"select_arrow_mc_2\")`。当前域 `getDefinition` 仍能拿到。本批 select.swf 目录无此文件。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1–3**：无名包。`MovieClip`。\n- **L5**：`[Embed(..., symbol=\"symbol73\")]`。\n- **L6**：`public dynamic class select_arrow_mc_2 extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–12 构造**：`super()`。无 `addFrameScript`。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `(无名包).select_arrow_mc_2` — P2 出战顺序箭头（空 MC）\n\n一句话目的：战前出战顺序 UI 里 P2 那侧的光标箭头。AS 空壳。本批导出在 loading.swf；引擎向 `select` 按名取。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/loading/scripts/select_arrow_mc_2.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`SelectIndexUI.initP2Group`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/select/SelectIndexUI.md) L158–159：\n\n```\nvar _loc3_:DisplayObject = ResUtils.I.createDisplayObject(ResUtils.I.select, \"select_arrow_mc_2\");\n_p2Group.initArrow(_loc3_, new Point(260, 30));\n```\n\n偏移 `(260, 30)`：P2 卡片朝右，箭头在条右侧。P1 对称件 [`select_arrow_mc_1`](./select_arrow_mc_1.md) 偏移 `(-10, 30)`。\n\n`initP2Group` 在模式 10（P2 `autoSelect`）、11（键 `\"P2\"`）、1