{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-80","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.md","content":"# `energy_bar` — 出战角色体力条（不是气）\n\n一句话目的：顶栏体力。`barmc.bar` 按 `energy/energyMax` 缩 `scaleX`；`txtmc` 按 `comicType` 切死神/火影字，低体力闪、overload 停红帧。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.energy1` / `energy2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new EnergyBar(_ui.energy1/2)`；P2 `setDirect(-1)` 只翻文字。\n\n[`EnergyBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md)：\n\n- `_bar = new InsBar(_ui.barmc.bar)` → 真正 `scaleX` 的那截，类型见 [`energybar_barmc`](energybar_barmc.md) / [`energybar_bar_8`](fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md)。\n- `_txt = new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`。期望 `txtmc.mc`（[`energybar_txt_mc_3`](fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md)）。\n- `setType(comicType)`：0 → `txtmc` 帧 1 死神，1 → 帧 2 火影。\n- overload → 条/字 `gotoAndStop(2)`；`rate<0.3` 闪 1↔2；否则帧 1。\n\n**不是** [`QiBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)。气 + 辅助气在 `ui_fight.fzqi1/2`。\n\nBITMAP：整块抬到 `ui_fight`。`destory` 只 null `_fighter`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol101\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energy_bar extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `barmc`**：[`energybar_barmc`](energybar_barmc.md)。体力条外壳，内层 `bar` 才被 InsBar 缩放。\n- **L11 `txtmc`**：声明 `MovieClip`。运行时是 [`fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3`](fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md)（有 `mc` 子级）。InsTxt 多处 `if(_mc.mc)` 护栏。\n- **L13–16 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。闪/overload 全在引擎 `InsBar` / `InsTxt`。\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-80","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `energy_bar` — 出战角色体力条（不是气）\n\n一句话目的：顶栏体力。`barmc.bar` 按 `energy/energyMax` 缩 `scaleX`；`txtmc` 按 `comicType` 切死神/火影字，低体力闪、overload 停红帧。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.energy1` / `energy2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new EnergyBar(_ui.energy1/2)`；P2 `setDirect(-1)` 只翻文字。\n\n[`EnergyBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md)：\n\n- `_bar = new InsBar(_ui.barmc.bar)` → 真正 `scaleX` 的那截，类型见 [`energybar_barmc`](energybar_barmc.md) / [`energybar_bar_8`](fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md)。\n- `_txt = new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`。期望 `txtmc.mc`（[`energybar_txt_mc_3`](fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md)）。\n- `setType(comicType)`：0 → `txtmc` 帧 1 死神，1 → 帧 2 火影。\n- overload → 条/字 `gotoAndStop(2)`；`rate<0.3` 闪 1↔2；否则帧 1。\n\n**不是** [`QiBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)。气 + 辅助气在 `ui_fight.fzqi1/2`。\n\nBITMAP：整块抬到 `ui_fight`。`destory` 只 null `_fighter`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol101\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energy_bar extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `barmc`**：[`energybar_barmc`](energybar_barmc.md)。体力条外壳，内层 `bar` 才被 InsBar 缩放。\n- **L11 `txtmc`**：声明 `MovieClip`。运行时是 [`fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3`](fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md)（有 `mc` 子级）。InsTxt 多处 `if(_mc.mc)` 护栏。\n- **L13–16 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。闪/overload 全在引擎 `InsBar` / `InsTxt`。\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-81","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/energybar_barmc.md","content":"# `energybar_barmc` — 体力条外壳\n\n一句话目的：体力条的外层。公开 `bar`；引擎只缩这一截的 `scaleX`，并在帧 1/2 间切正常/耗尽样式。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/energybar_barmc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.barmc`](energy_bar.md)。[`EnergyBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) 构造 `new InsBar(_ui.barmc.bar)`——绑的是 **内层 `bar`**，不是本 MC。\n\n`InsBar`：\n\n- `rate = energy/energyMax`，lerp `bar.scaleX`（系数 0.4）。\n- `normal()` → `bar.gotoAndStop(1)`。\n- `overLoad()` → `gotoAndStop(2)`（耗尽样式，scaleX 仍跟回复涨）。\n- `flash()`：每 3 逻辑帧在 1↔2 切。\n\n本类无帧脚本。内层 `bar` 的 Class 很可能是 [`fight_fla.energybar_bar_8`](fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md)（F1 `stop`，至少两帧）。声明类型是 `MovieClip`，AS 未写死嵌套类名。?\n\nP2 不翻本 MC（SWF `energy2` 已镜像）；只翻 `txtmc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol100\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_barmc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `bar`**：`MovieClip`。唯一公开槽。InsBar 的 `_mc`。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-81","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/energybar_barmc.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `energybar_barmc` — 体力条外壳\n\n一句话目的：体力条的外层。公开 `bar`；引擎只缩这一截的 `scaleX`，并在帧 1/2 间切正常/耗尽样式。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/energybar_barmc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.barmc`](energy_bar.md)。[`EnergyBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) 构造 `new InsBar(_ui.barmc.bar)`——绑的是 **内层 `bar`**，不是本 MC。\n\n`InsBar`：\n\n- `rate = energy/energyMax`，lerp `bar.scaleX`（系数 0.4）。\n- `normal()` → `bar.gotoAndStop(1)`。\n- `overLoad()` → `gotoAndStop(2)`（耗尽样式，scaleX 仍跟回复涨）。\n- `flash()`：每 3 逻辑帧在 1↔2 切。\n\n本类无帧脚本。内层 `bar` 的 Class 很可能是 [`fight_fla.energybar_bar_8`](fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md)（F1 `stop`，至少两帧）。声明类型是 `MovieClip`，AS 未写死嵌套类名。?\n\nP2 不翻本 MC（SWF `energy2` 已镜像）；只翻 `txtmc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol100\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_barmc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `bar`**：`MovieClip`。唯一公开槽。InsBar 的 `_mc`。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/energybar_barmc.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-82","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md","content":"# `fight_fla.energybar_bar_8` — 体力条内层 clip\n\n一句话目的：体力绿条真正被 `scaleX` 的那截 MovieClip。F1 `stop`，引擎再 `gotoAndStop(1|2)` 切正常/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.as`（21 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n无名包的 [`energybar_barmc.bar`](../energybar_barmc.md) 声明成 `MovieClip`。本类是 fight SWF 里对应元件的导出（`fight_fla` + FFDec 后缀 `_8`），**很可能**就是那层 `bar`。引擎从不 `getItemClass(\"energybar_bar_8\")`，只经 [`EnergyBar.InsBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) 拿到 `_ui.barmc.bar`。?\n\n`InsBar` 假定至少两帧：\n\n| 帧 | 谁切 | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `normal()`；闪的另一极 | 正常体力 |\n| 2 | `overLoad()`；`flash()` 种子 | 耗尽 / 闪红 |\n\n`rate` 改的是 `scaleX`，与当前停在哪一帧无关。overload 回复时条子在帧 2 上变长。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol97\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_bar_8 extends MovieClip`。无公开实例。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`super()`；`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → 时间轴 **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。防止时间轴自己播。引擎随后 `gotoAndStop(1|2)` 覆盖停帧。无 `COMPLETE`、无标签字符串（`in_bleach` 一类不在本 AS）。\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-82","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `fight_fla.energybar_bar_8` — 体力条内层 clip\n\n一句话目的：体力绿条真正被 `scaleX` 的那截 MovieClip。F1 `stop`，引擎再 `gotoAndStop(1|2)` 切正常/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.as`（21 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n无名包的 [`energybar_barmc.bar`](../energybar_barmc.md) 声明成 `MovieClip`。本类是 fight SWF 里对应元件的导出（`fight_fla` + FFDec 后缀 `_8`），**很可能**就是那层 `bar`。引擎从不 `getItemClass(\"energybar_bar_8\")`，只经 [`EnergyBar.InsBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) 拿到 `_ui.barmc.bar`。?\n\n`InsBar` 假定至少两帧：\n\n| 帧 | 谁切 | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `normal()`；闪的另一极 | 正常体力 |\n| 2 | `overLoad()`；`flash()` 种子 | 耗尽 / 闪红 |\n\n`rate` 改的是 `scaleX`，与当前停在哪一帧无关。overload 回复时条子在帧 2 上变长。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol97\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_bar_8 extends MovieClip`。无公开实例。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`super()`；`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → 时间轴 **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。防止时间轴自己播。引擎随后 `gotoAndStop(1|2)` 覆盖停帧。无 `COMPLETE`、无标签字符串（`in_bleach` 一类不在本 AS）。\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-83","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md","content":"# `fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3` — 体力条文字（死神/火影两帧）\n\n一句话目的：`energy_bar.txtmc` 的运行时类型。外层两帧切漫画风；内层 `mc` 给 InsTxt 做正常/闪/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.as`（23 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.txtmc`](../energy_bar.md) 声明 `MovieClip`。[`EnergyBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) `new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`，多处读 **`txtmc.mc`**。本类正好有 `public var mc`，F1 `stop`，对得上。引擎不按本类名 `getItemClass`。?\n\n`InsTxt.setType(comicType)` 切的是**外层本 MC**：\n\n| `comicType` | `gotoAndStop` | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | 帧 1 | 死神 |\n| 1 | 帧 2 | 火影 |\n| 其它 | 不切 | ? |\n\n`setDirect`：`txtmc.scaleX = ±1`（P2 -1）。闪/overload 改的是 **内层 `mc`** 的帧 1/2，不是外层。缺 `mc` 则只改旗、不切帧。\n\n切类型后内层 `mc` 可能被时间轴换实例；下一帧 `renderFlash` 读当前 `_mc.mc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol90\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_txt_mc_3 extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `mc`**：`MovieClip`。InsTxt 闪/overload 的目标。`normal`/`overLoad` → `mc.gotoAndStop(1|2)`；`flash` 每 3 逻辑帧 1↔2。\n- **L11–15 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L17–20 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停帧 1（死神）。`setType(1)` 才会到帧 2。无第二帧脚本——帧 2 的 `stop` 靠 SWF 标签或外层 `gotoAndStop` 钉住。?\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-83","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3` — 体力条文字（死神/火影两帧）\n\n一句话目的：`energy_bar.txtmc` 的运行时类型。外层两帧切漫画风；内层 `mc` 给 InsTxt 做正常/闪/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.as`（23 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.txtmc`](../energy_bar.md) 声明 `MovieClip`。[`EnergyBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) `new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`，多处读 **`txtmc.mc`**。本类正好有 `public var mc`，F1 `stop`，对得上。引擎不按本类名 `getItemClass`。?\n\n`InsTxt.setType(comicType)` 切的是**外层本 MC**：\n\n| `comicType` | `gotoAndStop` | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | 帧 1 | 死神 |\n| 1 | 帧 2 | 火影 |\n| 其它 | 不切 | ? |\n\n`setDirect`：`txtmc.scaleX = ±1`（P2 -1）。闪/overload 改的是 **内层 `mc`** 的帧 1/2，不是外层。缺 `mc` 则只改旗、不切帧。\n\n切类型后内层 `mc` 可能被时间轴换实例；下一帧 `renderFlash` 读当前 `_mc.mc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol90\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_txt_mc_3 extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `mc`**：`MovieClip`。InsTxt 闪/overload 的目标。`normal`/`overLoad` → `mc.gotoAndStop(1|2)`；`flash` 每 3 逻辑帧 1↔2。\n- **L11–15 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L17–20 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停帧 1（死神）。`setType(1)` 才会到帧 2。无第二帧脚本——帧 2 的 `stop` 靠 SWF 标签或外层 `gotoAndStop` 钉住。?\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-84","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_mc.md","content":"# `time_mc` — 回合计时容器（数字或「无限」）\n\n一句话目的：顶栏正中计时坑。有限时间由引擎往上叠 `MCNumber(time_txtmc)`；练习 `gameTimeMax==-1` 亮 `wuxian`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_mc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.timemc`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new FightTimeUI(_ui.timemc)`。\n\n[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md)：\n\n- `gameTimeMax==-1`：`_renderTime=false`，`wuxian.visible=true`，不建数字。练习。\n- 否则：`getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")` → [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)`(cls, 0, 1, 20, 2)`，偏移 `(-22,-15)`，`addChild` 到本 MC，藏 `wuxian`，初值 `gameTimeMax`。每逻辑帧写 `gameTime`。\n\nBITMAP：`timeUI` getter 返回 **MCNumber 不是本 MC**。无限模式 `_numMc==null`，不进 `_children`；`wuxian` 留在本 MC 里烤进 FightBar 底图。\n\n无 `destory`。下一回合不重建，只 `render` 跟上 `gameTime`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol132\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_mc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `wuxian`**：`MovieClip`。「无限」字。有限时间引擎 `visible=false`，MC 仍在显示列表。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本、无数字槽——数字是代码 `addChild`。\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-84","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_mc.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `time_mc` — 回合计时容器（数字或「无限」）\n\n一句话目的：顶栏正中计时坑。有限时间由引擎往上叠 `MCNumber(time_txtmc)`；练习 `gameTimeMax==-1` 亮 `wuxian`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_mc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.timemc`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new FightTimeUI(_ui.timemc)`。\n\n[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md)：\n\n- `gameTimeMax==-1`：`_renderTime=false`，`wuxian.visible=true`，不建数字。练习。\n- 否则：`getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")` → [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)`(cls, 0, 1, 20, 2)`，偏移 `(-22,-15)`，`addChild` 到本 MC，藏 `wuxian`，初值 `gameTimeMax`。每逻辑帧写 `gameTime`。\n\nBITMAP：`timeUI` getter 返回 **MCNumber 不是本 MC**。无限模式 `_numMc==null`，不进 `_children`；`wuxian` 留在本 MC 里烤进 FightBar 底图。\n\n无 `destory`。下一回合不重建，只 `render` 跟上 `gameTime`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol132\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_mc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `wuxian`**：`MovieClip`。「无限」字。有限时间引擎 `visible=false`，MC 仍在显示列表。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本、无数字槽——数字是代码 `addChild`。\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_mc.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-85","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.md","content":"# `time_txtmc` — 倒计时一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：计时每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。引擎 `getItemClass` 取 Class，`MCNumber` 每位 `new` 一颗，`gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不是** `time_mc` 上的嵌套实例。[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md) L31：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")\n```\n\n再 `new MCNumber(_loc3_, 0, 1, 20, 2)`：每格宽 20，**2 位补零**（`60`→`\"60\"`，`9`→`\"09\"`）。`startFrame=1` → 时间轴 **帧 1 = 数字 0**，帧 10 = 9。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n无限时间不取本 Class。每逻辑帧 `number=` 会拆掉重建两位 MC。\n\n无公开实例。无 `ct`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol24\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_txtmc extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停在 0 的字形。`MCNumber.createNum` 立刻 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)` 覆盖。帧 2–10 无脚本。?\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-85","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `time_txtmc` — 倒计时一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：计时每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。引擎 `getItemClass` 取 Class，`MCNumber` 每位 `new` 一颗，`gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不是** `time_mc` 上的嵌套实例。[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md) L31：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")\n```\n\n再 `new MCNumber(_loc3_, 0, 1, 20, 2)`：每格宽 20，**2 位补零**（`60`→`\"60\"`，`9`→`\"09\"`）。`startFrame=1` → 时间轴 **帧 1 = 数字 0**，帧 10 = 9。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n无限时间不取本 Class。每逻辑帧 `number=` 会拆掉重建两位 MC。\n\n无公开实例。无 `ct`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol24\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_txtmc extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停在 0 的字形。`MCNumber.createNum` 立刻 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)` 覆盖。帧 2–10 无脚本。?\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-86","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/score_mc.md","content":"# `score_mc` — 街机分数容器\n\n一句话目的：顶栏分数坑。只有 `ct`；引擎把 10 位 `MCNumber(txtmc_score)` 塞进去。仅街机亮。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/score_mc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.scoremc`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) 非 BITMAP 构造先 `scoremc.visible=false`。仅 `GameMode.isAcrade()`（10/20/30，拼写 Acrade）时 `FightUI` 构造调 `initScore()` → `new FightScoreUI(_ui.scoremc)`。\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md)：`getItemClass(..., \"txtmc_score\")`，`MCNumber(cls, 0, 1, 10, 10)` **`ct.addChild`**。`setScore` ← `FightUI.updateScore` ← `\"SCORE_UPDATE\"` 或 `initlize`。\n\nBITMAP：`scoremc` 已抬到 `ui_fight`，`ct` 仍在，addChild 有效。VS/练习永不 `initScore`。无 `destory` / `render`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol135\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class score_mc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `ct`**：`MovieClip`。唯一槽。数字不在时间轴上，是代码加的。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-86","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/score_mc.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `score_mc` — 街机分数容器\n\n一句话目的：顶栏分数坑。只有 `ct`；引擎把 10 位 `MCNumber(txtmc_score)` 塞进去。仅街机亮。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/score_mc.as`（17 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.scoremc`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) 非 BITMAP 构造先 `scoremc.visible=false`。仅 `GameMode.isAcrade()`（10/20/30，拼写 Acrade）时 `FightUI` 构造调 `initScore()` → `new FightScoreUI(_ui.scoremc)`。\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md)：`getItemClass(..., \"txtmc_score\")`，`MCNumber(cls, 0, 1, 10, 10)` **`ct.addChild`**。`setScore` ← `FightUI.updateScore` ← `\"SCORE_UPDATE\"` 或 `initlize`。\n\nBITMAP：`scoremc` 已抬到 `ui_fight`，`ct` 仍在，addChild 有效。VS/练习永不 `initScore`。无 `destory` / `render`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol135\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class score_mc extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `ct`**：`MovieClip`。唯一槽。数字不在时间轴上，是代码加的。\n- **L11–14 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/score_mc.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-87","title":"write","kind":"write","status":"pending","toolName":"write","rawInput":{"file_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.md","content":"# `txtmc_score` — 街机分数一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：分数每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。与 [`time_txtmc`](time_txtmc.md) 同模式：`getItemClass` 取 Class，不是嵌套实例。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md) L17：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"txtmc_score\")\n```\n\n`new MCNumber(_loc2_, 0, 1, 10, 10)`：每格宽 10，**10 位补零**（`0`→`\"0000000000\"`）。挂在 [`score_mc.ct`](score_mc.md)，不是本类。`startFrame=1` → 帧 1 = 数字 0。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n超过 10 位会继续加 MC（不截断）。负分 `int`→`uint` 会变成大正数；正常 `GameData.I.score≥0`。\n\n无公开实例。仅街机 `initScore` 才 new。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol216\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class txtmc_score extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认 0 字形。`createNum` 再 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n"},"content":[],"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-87","status":null,"content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `txtmc_score` — 街机分数一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：分数每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。与 [`time_txtmc`](time_txtmc.md) 同模式：`getItemClass` 取 Class，不是嵌套实例。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md) L17：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"txtmc_score\")\n```\n\n`new MCNumber(_loc2_, 0, 1, 10, 10)`：每格宽 10，**10 位补零**（`0`→`\"0000000000\"`）。挂在 [`score_mc.ct`](score_mc.md)，不是本类。`startFrame=1` → 帧 1 = 数字 0。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n超过 10 位会继续加 MC（不截断）。负分 `int`→`uint` 会变成大正数；正常 `GameData.I.score≥0`。\n\n无公开实例。仅街机 `initScore` 才 new。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol216\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class txtmc_score extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认 0 字形。`createNum` 再 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n"}],"rawOutput":null,"locations":[{"path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.md"}]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-83","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3` — 体力条文字（死神/火影两帧）\n\n一句话目的：`energy_bar.txtmc` 的运行时类型。外层两帧切漫画风；内层 `mc` 给 InsTxt 做正常/闪/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.as`（23 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.txtmc`](../energy_bar.md) 声明 `MovieClip`。[`EnergyBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) `new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`，多处读 **`txtmc.mc`**。本类正好有 `public var mc`，F1 `stop`，对得上。引擎不按本类名 `getItemClass`。?\n\n`InsTxt.setType(comicType)` 切的是**外层本 MC**：\n\n| `comicType` | `gotoAndStop` | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | 帧 1 | 死神 |\n| 1 | 帧 2 | 火影 |\n| 其它 | 不切 | ? |\n\n`setDirect`：`txtmc.scaleX = ±1`（P2 -1）。闪/overload 改的是 **内层 `mc`** 的帧 1/2，不是外层。缺 `mc` 则只改旗、不切帧。\n\n切类型后内层 `mc` 可能被时间轴换实例；下一帧 `renderFlash` 读当前 `_mc.mc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol90\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_txt_mc_3 extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `mc`**：`MovieClip`。InsTxt 闪/overload 的目标。`normal`/`overLoad` → `mc.gotoAndStop(1|2)`；`flash` 每 3 逻辑帧 1↔2。\n- **L11–15 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L17–20 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停帧 1（死神）。`setType(1)` 才会到帧 2。无第二帧脚本——帧 2 的 `stop` 靠 SWF 标签或外层 `gotoAndStop` 钉住。?\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3` — 体力条文字（死神/火影两帧）\n\n一句话目的：`energy_bar.txtmc` 的运行时类型。外层两帧切漫画风；内层 `mc` 给 InsTxt 做正常/闪/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.as`（23 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.txtmc`](../energy_bar.md) 声明 `MovieClip`。[`EnergyBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) `new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`，多处读 **`txtmc.mc`**。本类正好有 `public var mc`，F1 `stop`，对得上。引擎不按本类名 `getItemClass`。?\n\n`InsTxt.setType(comicType)` 切的是**外层本 MC**：\n\n| `comicType` | `gotoAndStop` | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | 帧 1 | 死神 |\n| 1 | 帧 2 | 火影 |\n| 其它 | 不切 | ? |\n\n`setDirect`：`txtmc.scaleX = ±1`（P2 -1）。闪/overload 改的是 **内层 `mc`** 的帧 1/2，不是外层。缺 `mc` 则只改旗、不切帧。\n\n切类型后内层 `mc` 可能被时间轴换实例；下一帧 `renderFlash` 读当前 `_mc.mc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol90\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_txt_mc_3 extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `mc`**：`MovieClip`。InsTxt 闪/overload 的目标。`normal`/`overLoad` → `mc.gotoAndStop(1|2)`；`flash` 每 3 逻辑帧 1↔2。\n- **L11–15 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L17–20 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停帧 1（死神）。`setType(1)` 才会到帧 2。无第二帧脚本——帧 2 的 `stop` 靠 SWF 标签或外层 `gotoAndStop` 钉住。?\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3` — 体力条文字（死神/火影两帧）\n\n一句话目的：`energy_bar.txtmc` 的运行时类型。外层两帧切漫画风；内层 `mc` 给 InsTxt 做正常/闪/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.as`（23 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.txtmc`](../energy_bar.md) 声明 `MovieClip`。[`EnergyBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) `new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`，多处读 **`txtmc.mc`**。本类正好有 `public var mc`，F1 `stop`，对得上。引擎不按本类名 `getItemClass`。?\n\n`InsTxt.setType(comicType)` 切的是**外层本 MC**：\n\n| `comicType` | `gotoAndStop` | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | 帧 1 | 死神 |\n| 1 | 帧 2 | 火影 |\n| 其它 | 不切 | ? |\n\n`setDirect`：`txtmc.scaleX = ±1`（P2 -1）。闪/overload 改的是 **内层 `mc`** 的帧 1/2，不是外层。缺 `mc` 则只改旗、不切帧。\n\n切类型后内层 `mc` 可能被时间轴换实例；下一帧 `renderFlash` 读当前 `_mc.mc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol90\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_txt_mc_3 extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `mc`**：`MovieClip`。InsTxt 闪/overload 的目标。`normal`/`overLoad` → `mc.gotoAndStop(1|2)`；`flash` 每 3 逻辑帧 1↔2。\n- **L11–15 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L17–20 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停帧 1（死神）。`setType(1)` 才会到帧 2。无第二帧脚本——帧 2 的 `stop` 靠 SWF 标签或外层 `gotoAndStop` 钉住。?\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md has been created.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md has been created.","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md","edits":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3` — 体力条文字（死神/火影两帧）\n\n一句话目的：`energy_bar.txtmc` 的运行时类型。外层两帧切漫画风；内层 `mc` 给 InsTxt 做正常/闪/overload。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.as`（23 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`energy_bar.txtmc`](../energy_bar.md) 声明 `MovieClip`。[`EnergyBar`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md) `new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`，多处读 **`txtmc.mc`**。本类正好有 `public var mc`，F1 `stop`，对得上。引擎不按本类名 `getItemClass`。?\n\n`InsTxt.setType(comicType)` 切的是**外层本 MC**：\n\n| `comicType` | `gotoAndStop` | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | 帧 1 | 死神 |\n| 1 | 帧 2 | 火影 |\n| 其它 | 不切 | ? |\n\n`setDirect`：`txtmc.scaleX = ±1`（P2 -1）。闪/overload 改的是 **内层 `mc`** 的帧 1/2，不是外层。缺 `mc` 则只改旗、不切帧。\n\n切类型后内层 `mc` 可能被时间轴换实例；下一帧 `renderFlash` 读当前 `_mc.mc`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L1** `package fight_fla`。\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol90\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energybar_txt_mc_3 extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `mc`**：`MovieClip`。InsTxt 闪/overload 的目标。`normal`/`overLoad` → `mc.gotoAndStop(1|2)`；`flash` 每 3 逻辑帧 1↔2。\n- **L11–15 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L17–20 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停帧 1（死神）。`setType(1)` 才会到帧 2。无第二帧脚本——帧 2 的 `stop` 靠 SWF 标签或外层 `gotoAndStop` 钉住。?\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-85","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `time_txtmc` — 倒计时一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：计时每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。引擎 `getItemClass` 取 Class，`MCNumber` 每位 `new` 一颗，`gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不是** `time_mc` 上的嵌套实例。[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md) L31：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")\n```\n\n再 `new MCNumber(_loc3_, 0, 1, 20, 2)`：每格宽 20，**2 位补零**（`60`→`\"60\"`，`9`→`\"09\"`）。`startFrame=1` → 时间轴 **帧 1 = 数字 0**，帧 10 = 9。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n无限时间不取本 Class。每逻辑帧 `number=` 会拆掉重建两位 MC。\n\n无公开实例。无 `ct`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol24\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_txtmc extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停在 0 的字形。`MCNumber.createNum` 立刻 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)` 覆盖。帧 2–10 无脚本。?\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `time_txtmc` — 倒计时一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：计时每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。引擎 `getItemClass` 取 Class，`MCNumber` 每位 `new` 一颗，`gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不是** `time_mc` 上的嵌套实例。[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md) L31：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")\n```\n\n再 `new MCNumber(_loc3_, 0, 1, 20, 2)`：每格宽 20，**2 位补零**（`60`→`\"60\"`，`9`→`\"09\"`）。`startFrame=1` → 时间轴 **帧 1 = 数字 0**，帧 10 = 9。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n无限时间不取本 Class。每逻辑帧 `number=` 会拆掉重建两位 MC。\n\n无公开实例。无 `ct`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol24\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_txtmc extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停在 0 的字形。`MCNumber.createNum` 立刻 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)` 覆盖。帧 2–10 无脚本。?\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `time_txtmc` — 倒计时一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：计时每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。引擎 `getItemClass` 取 Class，`MCNumber` 每位 `new` 一颗，`gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不是** `time_mc` 上的嵌套实例。[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md) L31：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")\n```\n\n再 `new MCNumber(_loc3_, 0, 1, 20, 2)`：每格宽 20，**2 位补零**（`60`→`\"60\"`，`9`→`\"09\"`）。`startFrame=1` → 时间轴 **帧 1 = 数字 0**，帧 10 = 9。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n无限时间不取本 Class。每逻辑帧 `number=` 会拆掉重建两位 MC。\n\n无公开实例。无 `ct`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol24\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_txtmc extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停在 0 的字形。`MCNumber.createNum` 立刻 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)` 覆盖。帧 2–10 无脚本。?\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.md has been created.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.md has been created.","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.md","edits":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `time_txtmc` — 倒计时一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：计时每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。引擎 `getItemClass` 取 Class，`MCNumber` 每位 `new` 一颗，`gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/time_txtmc.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n**不是** `time_mc` 上的嵌套实例。[`FightTimeUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightTimeUI.md) L31：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"time_txtmc\")\n```\n\n再 `new MCNumber(_loc3_, 0, 1, 20, 2)`：每格宽 20，**2 位补零**（`60`→`\"60\"`，`9`→`\"09\"`）。`startFrame=1` → 时间轴 **帧 1 = 数字 0**，帧 10 = 9。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n无限时间不取本 Class。每逻辑帧 `number=` 会拆掉重建两位 MC。\n\n无公开实例。无 `ct`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol24\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class time_txtmc extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认停在 0 的字形。`MCNumber.createNum` 立刻 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)` 覆盖。帧 2–10 无脚本。?\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-87","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `txtmc_score` — 街机分数一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：分数每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。与 [`time_txtmc`](time_txtmc.md) 同模式：`getItemClass` 取 Class，不是嵌套实例。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md) L17：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"txtmc_score\")\n```\n\n`new MCNumber(_loc2_, 0, 1, 10, 10)`：每格宽 10，**10 位补零**（`0`→`\"0000000000\"`）。挂在 [`score_mc.ct`](score_mc.md)，不是本类。`startFrame=1` → 帧 1 = 数字 0。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n超过 10 位会继续加 MC（不截断）。负分 `int`→`uint` 会变成大正数；正常 `GameData.I.score≥0`。\n\n无公开实例。仅街机 `initScore` 才 new。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol216\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class txtmc_score extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认 0 字形。`createNum` 再 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `txtmc_score` — 街机分数一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：分数每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。与 [`time_txtmc`](time_txtmc.md) 同模式：`getItemClass` 取 Class，不是嵌套实例。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md) L17：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"txtmc_score\")\n```\n\n`new MCNumber(_loc2_, 0, 1, 10, 10)`：每格宽 10，**10 位补零**（`0`→`\"0000000000\"`）。挂在 [`score_mc.ct`](score_mc.md)，不是本类。`startFrame=1` → 帧 1 = 数字 0。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n超过 10 位会继续加 MC（不截断）。负分 `int`→`uint` 会变成大正数；正常 `GameData.I.score≥0`。\n\n无公开实例。仅街机 `initScore` 才 new。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol216\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class txtmc_score extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认 0 字形。`createNum` 再 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"","new_string":"# `txtmc_score` — 街机分数一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：分数每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。与 [`time_txtmc`](time_txtmc.md) 同模式：`getItemClass` 取 Class，不是嵌套实例。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md) L17：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"txtmc_score\")\n```\n\n`new MCNumber(_loc2_, 0, 1, 10, 10)`：每格宽 10，**10 位补零**（`0`→`\"0000000000\"`）。挂在 [`score_mc.ct`](score_mc.md)，不是本类。`startFrame=1` → 帧 1 = 数字 0。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n超过 10 位会继续加 MC（不截断）。负分 `int`→`uint` 会变成大正数；正常 `GameData.I.score≥0`。\n\n无公开实例。仅街机 `initScore` 才 new。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol216\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class txtmc_score extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认 0 字形。`createNum` 再 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.md has been created.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.md has been created.","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.md","edits":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `txtmc_score` — 街机分数一位数字 MC\n\n一句话目的：分数每一位的字形。F1 `stop`。与 [`time_txtmc`](time_txtmc.md) 同模式：`getItemClass` 取 Class，不是嵌套实例。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/txtmc_score.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FightScoreUI`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightScoreUI.md) L17：\n\n```\nResUtils.I.getItemClass(ResUtils.I.fight, \"txtmc_score\")\n```\n\n`new MCNumber(_loc2_, 0, 1, 10, 10)`：每格宽 10，**10 位补零**（`0`→`\"0000000000\"`）。挂在 [`score_mc.ct`](score_mc.md)，不是本类。`startFrame=1` → 帧 1 = 数字 0。见 [`MCNumber`](../../../engine/kyo/display/MCNumber.md)。\n\n超过 10 位会继续加 MC（不截断）。负分 `int`→`uint` 会变成大正数；正常 `GameData.I.score≥0`。\n\n无公开实例。仅街机 `initScore` 才 new。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol216\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class txtmc_score extends MovieClip`。无字段。\n- **L9–13 构造**：`addFrameScript(0, frame1)` → **F1**。\n- **L15–18 `frame1`**：`stop()`。默认 0 字形。`createNum` 再 `gotoAndStop(1+digit)`。\n","new_line":1,"context_before":"","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ffc0c618-d35f-402a-a097-79acb8a52c3f-80","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.md","oldText":"","newText":"# `energy_bar` — 出战角色体力条（不是气）\n\n一句话目的：顶栏体力。`barmc.bar` 按 `energy/energyMax` 缩 `scaleX`；`txtmc` 按 `comicType` 切死神/火影字，低体力闪、overload 停红帧。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.energy1` / `energy2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new EnergyBar(_ui.energy1/2)`；P2 `setDirect(-1)` 只翻文字。\n\n[`EnergyBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/EnergyBar.md)：\n\n- `_bar = new InsBar(_ui.barmc.bar)` → 真正 `scaleX` 的那截，类型见 [`energybar_barmc`](energybar_barmc.md) / [`energybar_bar_8`](fight_fla/energybar_bar_8.md)。\n- `_txt = new InsTxt(_ui.txtmc)`。期望 `txtmc.mc`（[`energybar_txt_mc_3`](fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md)）。\n- `setType(comicType)`：0 → `txtmc` 帧 1 死神，1 → 帧 2 火影。\n- overload → 条/字 `gotoAndStop(2)`；`rate<0.3` 闪 1↔2；否则帧 1。\n\n**不是** [`QiBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/QiBar.md)。气 + 辅助气在 `ui_fight.fzqi1/2`。\n\nBITMAP：整块抬到 `ui_fight`。`destory` 只 null `_fighter`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **L5** `symbol=\"symbol101\"`。\n- **L6** `public dynamic class energy_bar extends MovieClip`。\n- **L9 `barmc`**：[`energybar_barmc`](energybar_barmc.md)。体力条外壳，内层 `bar` 才被 InsBar 缩放。\n- **L11 `txtmc`**：声明 `MovieClip`。运行时是 [`fight_fla.energybar_txt_mc_3`](fight_fla/energybar_txt_mc_3.md)（有 `mc` 子级）。InsTxt 多处 `if(_mc.mc)` 护栏。\n- **L13–16 构造**：只 `super()`。无帧脚本。闪/overload 全在引擎 `InsBar` / `InsTxt`。\n","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"","old_line":1,"new_string":"# `energy_bar` — 出战角色体力条（不是气）\n\n一句话目的：顶栏体力。`barmc.bar` 按 `energy/energyMax` 缩 `scaleX`；`txtmc` 按 `comicType` 切死神/火影字，低体力闪、overload 停红帧。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/ui/fight/scripts/energy_bar.as`（20 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`hpbar_mc.energy1` / `energy2`](hpbar_mc.md)。[`FightBar`](../../../engine/game/bvn/ui/fight/FightBar.md) `new En