{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-ba2ba73b-df9d-4600-b0b2-436591bed617-109","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/fighters/00-INDEX.md","oldText":"## 尚未开始\n\n- `decompiled/ui/**`\n- `decompiled/other/effect/**`（若另批）\n- 不要把 `fz/` 或主战 A–G 再注一遍","newText":"## 尚未开始\n\n- `decompiled/other/effect/**`（下一批；不要在 UI 批里开始）\n- 不要把 `fz/` 或主战 A–G 再注一遍\n- 不要把 `decompiled/ui/**` 再注一遍","_meta":{"details":[{"old_string":"## 尚未开始\n\n- `decompiled/ui/**`\n- `decompiled/other/effect/**`（若另批）\n- 不要把 `fz/` 或主战 A–G 再注一遍","old_line":46,"new_string":"## 尚未开始\n\n- `decompiled/other/effect/**`（下一批；不要在 UI 批里开始）\n- 不要把 `fz/` 或主战 A–G 再注一遍\n- 不要把 `decompiled/ui/**` 再注一遍","new_line":46,"context_before":"\nA 批模式备忘（AI 面 / 全动作 / face / hurt sound）写在 [`00-BATCH-A-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-A-INDEX.md)。B 批（我爱罗 / 葛力姆乔 / 一护四形态 / 零段三形态）写在 [`00-BATCH-B-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-B-INDEX.md)。C 批（一角 / 鼬 / 自来也 / 重吾 / 卡卡西 / 神威 / 香磷）写在 [`00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-C-INDEX.md)。D 批（剑八 / 剑心两形态 / 奇拉比 / 小南 / 小李两形态 / 斑 / 涅茧利）写在 [`00-BATCH-D-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-D-INDEX.md)。E 批（鸣人三形态 / 仙人黄金 / 宁次 / 带土两形态 / 织姬）写在 [`00-BATCH-E-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-E-INDEX.md)。F 批（大蛇丸 / 佩恩 / 恋次 / 露琪亚两形态 / 樱 / 佐助两形态 / 须佐能乎）写在 [`00-BATCH-F-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-F-INDEX.md)。G 批（须佐旧档 / 碎蜂 / 手鞠 / 东狮郎两形态 / 乌尔奇奥拉两形态 / 雨龙 / 银）写在 [`00-BATCH-G-INDEX.md`](00-BATCH-G-INDEX.md)。\n\n","context_after":"","line_prefix":""}]}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"SearchReplace","EditsApplied":{"old_string":"## 尚未开始\n\n- `decompiled/ui/**`\n- `decompiled/other/effect/**`（若另批）\n- 不要把 `fz/` 或主战 A–G 再注一遍","new_string":"## 尚未开始\n\n- `decompiled/other/effect/**`（下一批；不要在 UI 批里开始）\n- 不要把 `fz/` 或主战 A–G 再注一遍\n- 不要把 `decompiled/ui/**` 再注一遍","tool_output_for_prompt":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/fighters/00-INDEX.md has been updated successfully.","tool_output_for_prompt_concise":"The file /workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/fighters/00-INDEX.md has been updated.","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/revers